  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Scope**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the user\'s specific requirements. The primary goal is a polished task tracker, \"MIHIR Workspace,\" custom-built for Ray project work. I\'m focusing on the name, its folder location, and the preservation of existing content, if any. The creation will happen in a folder named MIHIR inside the selected workspace.\n\n\n"
