  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Architecture**\n\nI\'m focusing now on outlining the core components of the system. I want to ensure the design is clean, specifically addressing logic, data types, validation routines, date/timezone management (with an `Asia/Kolkata` default), and precise date formats. I\'m also planning the Git workflow readiness calculation, dashboard metric aggregations, search/filter/sort capabilities, and backup/restore functionality.\n\n\n**Refining Implementation Strategy**\n\nI\'ve decided to house validation in decoupled TypeScript modules within `MIHIR/src/lib/`, importing them into `src/` and `server.ts`. These modules will be thoroughly unit tested with `tsx --test`. For persistence, I\'m leaning toward using Node\'s built-in `node:sqlite` within `server.ts`, `MIHIR/server/db.ts`, and `MIHIR/server/seedAssets.ts` to store data in `/MIHIR/data/mihir_workspace.sqlite` and uploaded files in `/MIHIR/uploads/`.\nI\'m also considering updating `package.json` to use `\"tsx server.ts\"` for both `\"dev\"` and `\"start\"` to have the server handle everything, including REST API, SQLite, uploads, and the React frontend.\n\n\n**Defining Data Schema**\n\nI\'m now focusing on solidifying the data schema and domain model. I need to ensure it thoroughly covers every requirement from the project brief. I\'m starting by defining the task statuses, priorities, and git workflow stages. This includes a clear structure for local and commit-related actions. Finally, I\'ll update `/package.json` to include `\"build\"` script for a clean `vite build`.\n\n\n**Structuring Workflow Stages**\n\nI\'m currently formalizing the workflow stages within the task repository. I\'ve defined stages like `commit_local`, `push_remote`, and `verify_cloud`, along with their categories, such as \'local\', \'push\', and \'deploy\'. Each stage will have an ID, label, status, and associated data like source/target branches and reference values. The status will track progress, and a completed timestamp will be recorded.\n\n\n**Formalizing Project Structures**\n\nI\'m now detailing task repository links. I\'m focusing on defining properties like `repositoryId`, `repositoryName`, and branch-related configurations for each repository attached to a task. I\'m also capturing workflow specifics like `workflowMode`. Then, I\'m documenting all the stages. I\'m defining a structure for recording problems, investigations, requirements, and behaviors as well.\n\n\n**Detailing Incident Data**\n\nI\'m now detailing incident data. I\'m focusing on attributes like `stepsToReproduce`, `investigationNotes`, and the `rootCause`. I\'m also capturing `approachesConsidered`, and the `finalSolution`, including `whyChosen`. I\'ll address `limitationsFollowUp`, too. I am going to record the data associated with `TaskFileChange` and `TaskAttachment` types as well.\n\n\n\n**Defining Data Schemas**\n\nI\'m currently documenting schemas for `TaskTestRecord`, which will include test type, results, and logs, as well as `TimeEntry` for work sessions and `ActivityItem` to track all activity types. I am making sure that I handle all the key attributes for each entry.\n\n\n**Cataloging Project and Repo Data**\n\nI\'m working on defining `ProjectConfig`, `RepositoryConfig`, and `WorkspaceSettings` now. I\'m focusing on attributes like project names, repository details (paths, URLs, branches, cloud targets, and workflow modes), theme, timezone, and settings for cloud target labels and workflow mode. I\'m also specifying attachment size limits, required completion checks, tags, and active timer details.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_201287"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type TaskStatus =\\n  | \'Backlog\'\\n  | \'Assigned\'\\n  | \'In Progress\'\\n  | \'Blocked\'\\n  | \'Ready for Testing\'\\n  | \'In Review\'\\n  | \'Done\';\\n\\nexport type TaskPriority = \'Low\' | \'Medium\' | \'High\' | \'Urgent\';\\n\\nexport type ChangeType = \'Added\' | \'Modified\' | \'Deleted\' | \'Renamed\';\\n\\nexport type AttachmentCategory = \'Before\' | \'After\' | \'Reference\' | \'Testing\';\\n\\nexport type TestType = \'Manual\' | \'Unit\' | \'Integration\' | \'Build\' | \'Lint\' | \'Other\';\\n\\nexport type TestStatus = \'Not Run\' | \'Passed\' | \'Failed\' | \'Blocked\' | \'Skipped\';\\n\\nexport type GitStageStatus =\\n  | \'Not Started\'\\n  | \'In Progress\'\\n  | \'Completed\'\\n  | \'Blocked\'\\n  | \'Not Applicable\';\\n\\nexport type GitStageCategory = \'local\' | \'commit\' | \'push\' | \'merge\' | \'deploy\';\\n\\nexport type WorkflowMode = \'PR-Based\' | \'Direct Merge\';\\n\\nexport interface GitWorkflowStage {\\n  id: string;\\n  stageKey: string;\\n  stepNumber: number;\\n  label: string;\\n  category: GitStageCategory;\\n  status: GitStageStatus;\\n  completedAt: string | null;\\n  notes: string;\\n  sourceBranch: string;\\n  targetBranch: string;\\n  referenceValue: string; // commit hash, PR URL, or deployment URL\\n  referenceType: \'commit\' | \'pr\' | \'deployment\' | \'branch\' | \'none\';\\n  recordingMode: \'Manual\' | \'Integration\';\\n  notApplicableReason: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TaskRepository {\\n  id: string;\\n  repositoryId: string;\\n  repositoryName: string;\\n  remoteUrl: string;\\n  localFolderPath: string;\\n  baseBranch: string;\\n  workingBranch: string;\\n  devTargetBranch: string;\\n  cloudTargetName: string;\\n  workflowMode: WorkflowMode;\\n  stages: GitWorkflowStage[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TaskInvestigation {\\n  originalRequirement: string;\\n  actualBehavior: string;\\n  expectedBehavior: string;\\n  stepsToReproduce: string;\\n  investigationNotes: string;\\n  rootCause: string;\\n  approachesConsidered: string;\\n  finalSolution: string;\\n  whyChosen: string;\\n  limitationsFollowUp: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TaskFileChange {\\n  id: string;\\n  repositoryName: string;\\n  filePath: string;\\n  changeType: ChangeType;\\n  whatChanged: string;\\n  whyChanged: string;\\n  solutionContribution: string;\\n  codeSnippet: string;\\n  relatedCommit: string;\\n  testingNotes: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TaskAttachment {\\n  id: string;\\n  fileName: string;\\n  originalName: string;\\n  mimeType: string;\\n  sizeBytes: number;\\n  url: string;\\n  category: AttachmentCategory;\\n  caption: string;\\n  notes: string;\\n  linkedFileChangeId: string | null;\\n  linkedTestId: string | null;\\n  uploadedAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TaskTestRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  title: string;\\n  testType: TestType;\\n  commandOrSteps: string;\\n  expectedResult: string;\\n  actualResult: string;\\n  status: TestStatus;\\n  testedAt: string;\\n  relatedAttachmentId: string | null;\\n  logs: string;\\n  blockedOrSkippedReason: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TimeEntry {\\n  id: string;\\n  taskId: string;\\n  taskCode: string;\\n  taskTitle: string;\\n  startedAt: string;\\n  endedAt: string | null;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  notes: string;\\n  isManual: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ActivityItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  taskId: string | null;\\n  taskCode: string | null;\\n  actionType: \'status\' | \'note\' | \'file\' | \'attachment\' | \'test\' | \'git\' | \'timer\' | \'system\';\\n  summary: string;\\n  details: string;\\n  timestamp: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WorkNote {\\n  id: string;\\n  taskId: string | null;\\n  taskCode: string | null;\\n  title: string;\\n  content: string;\\n  tags: string[];\\n  createdAt: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TaskRecord {\\n  id: string;\\n  taskCode: string; // e.g., MIHIR-001\\n  title: string;\\n  description: