  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Frontend Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m focusing on building the modular frontend components now, specifically within `/MIHIR/src/components/`. I\'m meticulously adhering to the principles of `frontend-design` and `ultra-mode`. I\'m leaning toward a clean, calm aesthetic inspired by Linear and Notion, and incorporating a collapsible left sidebar and a clean top bar.\n\n\n**Refining Component Interactions**\n\nI\'m now integrating a search function and a \"New Task\" button into the main content area, all within a spacious layout. I\'m prioritizing single-elevation cards using `border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800`, tabular numerals, and accessible Light and Dark themes. I\'m absolutely rejecting any \"AI slop\" or unnecessary visual clutter; every interactive element is a proper native control with visible labels or `aria-label`. The first component I\'m building is `/MIHIR/src/components/NewTaskModal.tsx`.\n\n\n**Defining Task Interaction Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing task interactions, starting with ticket URLs, tags, and expected outcomes, with multi-repository selection in mind for `raydashboard`, `rayhubapp`, and `rayjobapp`. I\'m working out the per-repository configurations: base branch, working branch (with auto-suggestion), dev target branch, and cloud/release target. I am moving on to planning `/MIHIR/src/components/QuickModals.tsx` and `/MIHIR/src/components/DashboardView.tsx`.\n\n\n**Implementing Task Displays**\n\nI\'ve crafted an empty state design for situations with no tasks. I am now working on `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx`. I am planning to implement a segmented toggle between Table and Kanban views, with clear segment titles. I am also planning on a robust search input and advanced filters. Per-task actions are designed to be accessible. The `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx` will have a header with various controls, and provide a comprehensive workspace.\n\n\n**Structuring Task Detail Views**\n\nI\'m now designing `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx` with a focus on task information organization. I\'m building a Tab-based interface with seven clear tabs, each focusing on specific aspects. The first tab, \"Overview & Workspace,\" will include editable fields for task details and a repository manager. The second tab, \"Problem & Investigation,\" will provide structured areas for documenting problem analysis, with toggleable edit/preview modes and explicit save indicators.\n\n\n**Detailing File Changes**\n\nI\'m now focusing on Tab 3, \"Changed Files,\" within the task detail view. I\'m building out the design to include filters by repository, and to allow add/edit/delete functionality for file change records. I\'m prioritizing a clear display of the file path (monospace with a copy button), and the inclusion of change type, reasons for change, and a code snippet viewer.\n\n\n**Expanding Test Functionality**\n\nI\'m now detailing Tab 5, \"Testing & Verification,\" and making progress on adding test records to it. I\'m focusing on defining fields like test type (Manual, Unit, Integration, etc.), command or reproduction steps, and statuses (Passed, Failed, Blocked, etc.) along with linked screenshots and logs. I\'m prioritizing clear visual cues for blocked tests (highlighted in amber/red with reason) and making sure they\'re never counted as passed. I\'m aiming for a robust and user-friendly system.\n\n\n**Planning Deployment Readiness**\n\nI\'m now detailing the cloud deployments section. I\'m building an interactive 14-stage stepper, and focusing on status updates and reason logging for \"Not Applicable\". I\'m implementing a task completion readiness gate with checks and an explicit complete button. The seventh tab, \"Time & Activity,\" will have auto-timestamps, timer controls, and a work history table.\n\n\n**Defining Project and Repo Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on defining project and repository configuration details, specifically within the new UI component `/MIHIR/src/components/SettingsView.tsx`. I am working on building controls for the local folder path (with a \"Copy Path\" button), the remote URL, default branches, and the cloud target. I am moving on to adding functionality to build daily and weekly work summaries in `/MIHIR/src/components/WorkLogView.tsx`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_419135"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { X, Plus, GitBranch, FolderGit2 } from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  ProjectConfig,\\n  RepositoryConfig,\\n  TaskPriority,\\n  TaskRecord,\\n  TaskStatus,\\n} from \'../types/workspace\';\\n\\ninterface NewTaskModalProps {\\n  isOpen: boolean;\\n  onClose: () => void;\\n  projects: ProjectConfig[];\\n  repositories: RepositoryConfig[];\\n  availableTags: string[];\\n  suggestedTaskCode: string;\\n  onCreateTask: (payload: any) => Promise<TaskRecord | null>;\\n}\\n\\nexport const NewTaskModal: React.FC<NewTaskModalProps> = ({\\n  isOpen,\\n  onClose,\\n  projects,\\n  repositories,\\n  availableTags,\\n  suggestedTaskCode,\\n  onCreateTask,\\n}) => {\\n  const [title, setTitle] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [taskCode, setTaskCode] = useState(suggestedTaskCode);\\n  const [projectName, setProjectName] = useState(projects[0]?.name || \'Ray\');\\n  const [priority, setPriority] = useState<TaskPriority>(\'High\');\\n  const [status, setStatus] = useState<TaskStatus>(\'Assigned\');\\n  const [assignedBy, setAssignedBy] = useState(\'Vikram Desai\');\\n  const [dueDate, setDueDate] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [ticketUrl, setTicketUrl] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [description, setDescription] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [expectedOutcome, setExpectedOutcome] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [acceptanceCriteria, setAcceptanceCriteria] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [selectedTags, setSelectedTags] = useState<string[]>([]);\\n  const [selectedRepos, setSelectedRepos] = useState<\\n    Array<{\\n      repositoryId: string;\\n      baseBranch: string;\\n      workingBranch: string;\\n      devTargetBranch: string;\\n      cloudTargetName: string;\\n    }>\\n  >(() => {\\n    const first = repositories[0];\\n    if (!first) return [];\\n    return [\\n      {\\n        repositoryId: first.id,\\n        baseBranch: first.defaultBaseBranch,\\n        workingBranch: `RAY-MIHIR-${suggestedTaskCode}`,\\n        devTargetBranch: first.defaultDevBranch,\\n        cloudTargetName: first.cloudTargetName,\\n      },\\n    ];\\n  });\\n  const [error, setError] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [submitting, setSubmitting] = useState(false);\\n\\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\\n\\n  const handleToggleRepo = (repo: RepositoryConfig) => {\\n    const exists = selectedRepos.some((r) => r.repositoryId === repo.id);\\n    if (exists) {\\n      setSelectedRepos(selectedRepos.filter((r) => r.repositoryId !== repo.id));\\n    } else {\\n      setSelectedRepos([\\n        ...selectedRepos,\\n        {\\n          repositoryId: repo.id,\\n          baseBranch: repo.defaultBaseBranch,\\n          workingBranch: `RAY-MIHIR-${taskCode || suggestedTaskCode}`,\\n          devTargetBranch: repo.defaultDevBranch,\\n          cloudTargetName: repo.cloudTargetName,\\n        },\\n      ]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleUpdateRepoField = (\\n    repositoryId: string,\\n    field: \'baseBranch\' | \'workingBranch\' | \'devTargetBranch\' | \'cloudTargetName\',\\n    value: string\\n  ) => {\\n    setSelectedRepos(\\n      selectedRepos.map((item) =>\\n        item.repositoryId === repositoryId ? { ...item, [field]: value } : item\\n      )\\n    );\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleToggleTag = (tag: string) => {\\n    if (selectedTags.includes(tag)) {\\n      setSelectedTags(selectedTags.filter((t) => t !== tag));\\n    } else {\\n      setSelectedTags([...selectedTags, tag]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSubmit = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!title.trim()) {\\n      setError(\'Please enter a clear task title.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    setError(\'\');\\n    setSubmitting(true);\\n    try {\\n      const created = await onCreateTask({\\n        title: title.trim(),\\n        taskCode: taskCode.trim() || suggestedTaskCode,\\n        projectName,\\n        priority,\\n        status,\\n        assignedBy: assignedBy.trim() || \'Self\',\\n        dueDate: dueDate ? new Date(dueDate).toISOString() : null,\\n        ticketUrl: ticketUrl.trim(),\\n        description: description.trim(),\\n        expectedOutcome: expectedOutcome.trim(),\\n        acceptanceCriteria: acceptanceCriteria.trim(),\\n        tags: selectedTags,\\n        selectedRepoConfigs: selectedRepos,\\n      });\\n      if (created) {\\n        onClose();\\n      }\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      setError(err?.message || \'Failed to create task.\');\\n    } finally {\\n      setSubmitting(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-xs p-4 overflow-y-auto\\\"\\n      role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n      aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n      aria-labelledby=\\\"new-task-modal-title\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl w-full max-w-3xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden shadow-xl\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h2 id=\\\"new-task-modal-title\\\" className=\\\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n              Create New Developer Task\\n            </h2>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n              Record assignment details, target repositories, and working branches. Detailed investigation notes can be added anytime.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={onClose}\\n            aria-label=\\\"Close new task modal\\\"\\n            className=\\\"p-2 rounded-lg text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\\\"\\n          >\\n            <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"p-6 overflow-y-auto space-y-5 flex-1\\\">\\n          {error && (\\n            <div role=\\\"alert\\\" className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/50 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900 text-xs text-red-700 dark:text-red-300\\\">\\n              {error}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-code\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Task ID\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                id=\\\"new-task-code\\\"\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={taskCode}\\n                onChange={(e) => setTaskCode(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-mono rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\\\"\\n                placeholder=\\\"MIHIR-005\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-3\\\">\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-title\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Task Title *\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                id=\\\"new-task-title\\\"\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={title}\\n                onChange={(e) => setTitle(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\\\"\\n                placeholder=\\\"e.g., Add SSL/TLS certificate chain validation in raydashboard\\\"\\n                autoFocus\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-project\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Project\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                id=\\\"new-task-project\\\"\\n                value={projectName}\\n                onChange={(e) => setProjectName(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n              >\\n                {projects.map((p) => (\\n                  <option key={p.id} value={p.name}>\\n                    {p.name}\\n                  </option>\\n                ))}\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-status\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Initial Status\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                id=\\\"new-task-status\\\"\\n                value={status}\\n                onChange={(e) => setStatus(e.target.value as TaskStatus)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n              >\\n                <option value=\\\"Backlog\\\">Backlog</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Assigned\\\">Assigned</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"In Progress\\\">In Progress</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Blocked\\\">Blocked</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Ready for Testing\\\">Ready for Testing</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"In Review\\\">In Review</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-priority\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Priority\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                id=\\\"new-task-priority\\\"\\n                value={priority}\\n                onChange={(e) => setPriority(e.target.value as TaskPriority)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n              >\\n                <option value=\\\"Low\\\">Low</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Medium\\\">Medium</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"High\\\">High</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Urgent\\\">Urgent</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-duedate\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Due Date\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                id=\\\"new-task-duedate\\\"\\n                type=\\\"date\\\"\\n                value={dueDate}\\n                onChange={(e) => setDueDate(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-mono rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-assignedby\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Assigned By\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                id=\\\"new-task-assignedby\\\"\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={assignedBy}\\n                onChange={(e) => setAssignedBy(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n                placeholder=\\\"e.g., Vikram Desai / Neha Sharma\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-ticketurl\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Task Source / Ticket URL\\n              </label>\\n              <input\\n                id=\\\"new-task-ticketurl\\\"\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={ticketUrl}\\n                onChange={(e) => setTicketUrl(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-mono rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n                placeholder=\\\"https://ray.internal/browse/RAY-...\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Repositories & Branches section */}\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-3 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <FolderGit2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\" />\\n                Target Repositories & Branch Configuration\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500\\\">Select one or more repositories</span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\\\">\\n              {repositories.map((repo) => {\\n                const isSelected = selectedRepos.some((r) => r.repositoryId === repo.id);\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={repo.id}\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => handleToggleRepo(repo)}\\n                    className={`px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono font-medium border transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                      isSelected\\n                        ? \'bg-indigo-600 text-white border-indigo-600\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 hover:border-indigo-400\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {isSelected ? \'\342\234\223 \' : \'+ \'}\\n                    {repo.name}\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {selectedRepos.length > 0 && (\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5\\\">\\n                {selectedRepos.map((sel) => {\\n                  const repoObj = repositories.find((r) => r.id === sel.repositoryId);\\n                  return (\\n                    <div\\n                      key={sel.repositoryId}\\n                      className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-2\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                        <span className=\\\"font-mono font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                          <GitBranch className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                          {repoObj?.name || sel.repositoryId}\\n                        </span>\\n                        <span className=\\\"font-mono text-slate-500 truncate max-w-xs\\\">\\n                          {repoObj?.localFolderPath}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2\\\">\\n                        <div>\\n                          <label className=\\\"block text-[11px] text-slate-500 mb-0.5\\\">Base Branch</label>\\n                          <input\\n                            type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                            value={sel.baseBranch}\\n                            onChange={(e) => handleUpdateRepoField(sel.repositoryId, \'baseBranch\', e.target.value)}\\n                            className=\\\"w-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900\\\"\\n                            placeholder=\\\"development2\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"sm:col-span-2\\\">\\n                          <label className=\\\"block text-[11px] text-slate-500 mb-0.5\\\">Working Branch</label>\\n                          <input\\n                            type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                            value={sel.workingBranch}\\n                            onChange={(e) => handleUpdateRepoField(sel.repositoryId, \'workingBranch\', e.target.value)}\\n                            className=\\\"w-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900\\\"\\n                            placeholder=\\\"RAY-MIHIR-Security-Graphs\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div>\\n                          <label className=\\\"block text-[11px] text-slate-500 mb-0.5\\\">Dev Target</label>\\n                          <input\\n                            type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                            value={sel.devTargetBranch}\\n                            onChange={(e) => handleUpdateRepoField(sel.repositoryId, \'devTargetBranch\', e.target.value)}\\n                            className=\\\"w-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono rounded border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900\\\"\\n                            placeholder=\\\"development2\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  );\\n                })}\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-desc\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n              What Was Requested (Summary & Context)\\n            </label>\\n            <textarea\\n              id=\\\"new-task-desc\\\"\\n              rows={3}\\n              value={description}\\n              onChange={(e) => setDescription(e.target.value)}\\n              className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n              placeholder=\\\"Describe what was requested, any initial reproduction clues, or specific behavior to change...\\\"\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-outcome\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Expected Outcome\\n              </label>\\n              <textarea\\n                id=\\\"new-task-outcome\\\"\\n                rows={2}\\n                value={expectedOutcome}\\n                onChange={(e) => setExpectedOutcome(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n                placeholder=\\\"Desired end-user or system outcome...\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label htmlFor=\\\"new-task-criteria\\\" className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1\\\">\\n                Acceptance Criteria\\n              </label>\\n              <textarea\\n                id=\\\"new-task-criteria\\\"\\n                rows={2}\\n                value={acceptanceCriteria}\\n                onChange={(e) => setAcceptanceCriteria(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-3 py-2 text-sm rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\"\\n                placeholder=\\\"1. Verified on development2...\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div>\\n            <span className=\\\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 mb-1.5\\\">\\n              Tags\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\\\">\\n              {availableTags.map((tag) => {\\n                const active = selectedTags.includes(tag);\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={tag}\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => handleToggleTag(tag)}\\n                    className={`px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-xs transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                      active\\n                        ? \'bg-indigo-600 text-white font-medium\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    #{tag}\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-end gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={onClose}\\n              className=\\\"px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              Cancel\\n            </button>\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n              disabled={submitting}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-white bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 disabled:opacity-50 rounded-lg transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Plus className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n              {submitting ? \'Creating Task...\' : \'Create Task\'}\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create NewTaskModal component in MIHIR/src/components/NewTaskModal.tsx\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/MIHIR/src/components/NewTaskModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating NewTaskModal.tsx component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create NewTaskModal.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
