  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Layouts Critically**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously examining the layouts, especially the mobile rendition. The desktop version\'s clean lines and font choices \342\200\223 Plus Jakarta Sans, DM Sans, and JetBrains Mono \342\200\223 are a great starting point, but I\'m now drilling down on the mobile interface. My focus is on ensuring those fonts and proportions translate effectively to smaller screens.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile UI**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the mobile view in detail. I\'ve spotted an overflow issue with the repository filter bar in `r1-mobile.png`, specifically the clipping of the last item, which needs an `overflow-x-auto max-w-full` fix. Also, a test activity entry needs removal from the engineering activity timeline. Before correcting those issues, let\'s run interactive journeys to confirm these UI issues.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1606181"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\n    // 1. Click into MIHIR-001 or MIHIR-003 Screenshots & Attachments\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /MIHIR-003/i }).first().click().catch(async () => {\\n      await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /My Tasks/i }).click();\\n      await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: \\\"MIHIR-001\\\" }).click();\\n    });\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"tab\\\", { name: /Screenshots & Attachments/i }).click();\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r1-task-attachments.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // 2. Switch to Git & Release Workflow tab\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"tab\\\", { name: /Git & Release Workflow/i }).click();\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r1-task-git.png\\\" });\\n\\n    // 3. Go to My Tasks -> Switch to Kanban Board & switch to Light theme\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /My Tasks/i }).click();\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Kanban Board/i }).click();\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Theme:/i }).click();\\n    await page.screenshot({ path: \\\".playwright-cli/r1-tasks-kanban-light.png\\\" });\\n    // Restore dark theme\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\"button\\\", { name: /Theme:/i }).click();\\n  }\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/\", \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":10000, \"toolAction\":\"Running interactive journeys across Task Detail, Attachments, Git Stepper, Kanban, and Light Theme\", \"toolSummary\":\"Run interactive browser journeys\"}"
