  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visual Defects**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the initial visual defect: a high-severity contrast issue within `r` captures under the light theme. I\'m prioritizing outlining the most significant problems first, starting with concrete fixes. The \'ultra-mode\' visual verification has proven quite valuable. Now it\'s time to refine this initial assessment for clarity.\n\n\n**Investigating Theme Inconsistency**\n\nI\'m now diving into the light theme rendering issues. Specifically, I\'m tracing the dark backgrounds on Kanban cards and the \"Archived (0)\" button within `r1-tasks-kanban-light.png`. It seems the problem lies within how the theme is being applied, likely in `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx` and the interplay between `index.html` and `src/index.css`. I\'m closely examining the Tailwind configuration, focusing on `@custom-variant dark` to understand why some elements are rendered darkly in light mode.\n\n\n**Unraveling Unexpected Behavior**\n\nI\'m now really puzzled by an odd inconsistency. While the main background is white, the Kanban card persists with a dark background. I\'m retracing the sequence of events. Did the dark class remain on the HTML element before the screenshot? I\'m checking the `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx` theme toggle and `apiRequest` delay. I\'m still trying to figure out why a white background and dark background appear in the same frame! This discrepancy demands further investigation.\n\n\n**Pinpointing the Transition Effect**\n\nI\'ve got it! The Kanban card\'s dark background is a visual illusion created by the `transition-colors` class combined with the screenshot timing. The filter bar, lacking the transition, immediately renders white when dark mode is disabled. The Kanban card, however, is caught mid-transition due to that `transition-colors` class. This explains the discrepancy, right? I\'m now certain this is the root cause. This could be a sneaky timing issue with the screenshot capture.\n\n\n**Addressing Theme Persistence**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough! My thought process has led me to identify a critical issue in `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`. The theme state wasn\'t being updated optimistically before the `fetch(\'/api/settings\')` call, which is very problematic. I\'m now certain I\'ll need to update `workspace.settings.theme` immediately and toggle `document.documentElement.classList` synchronously on click! Also, I need to remove `transition-colors` from the cards so theme changes are instantaneous.\n\n\n**Optimizing UI Layout**\n\nI\'m now focusing on layout issues. I\'ve pinpointed two specific problems. First, the tab labels in the sidebar are causing horizontal overflow on a 1440px viewport when the sidebar is expanded. I\'m going to shorten the labels and use compact padding or flex-wrap to ensure all seven tabs fit without clipping. Secondly, the mobile repository filter in `DashboardView.tsx` is overflowing horizontally at 390px width. I\'ll use `flex-wrap` here, too.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1448379"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Allow repository filter buttons on Dashboard to wrap cleanly on mobile viewports\", \"EndLine\":218, \"Instruction\":\"Add flex-wrap to the repository segmented control container in DashboardView.tsx\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"          <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 max-w-full\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setSelectedRepo(\'All\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                selectedRepo === \'All\'\\n                  ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 shadow-2xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              All Repositories\\n            </button>\\n            {repositories.map((repo) => (\\n              <button\\n                key={repo.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setSelectedRepo(repo.name)}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  selectedRepo === repo.name\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 shadow-2xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {repo.name}\\n              </button>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\", \"StartLine\":188, \"TargetContent\":\"          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setSelectedRepo(\'All\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                selectedRepo === \'All\'\\n                  ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 shadow-2xs\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              All Repositories\\n            </button>\\n            {repositories.map((repo) => (\\n              <button\\n                key={repo.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setSelectedRepo(repo.name)}\\n                className={`px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  selectedRepo === repo.name\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 shadow-2xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                {repo.name}\\n              </button>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/MIHIR/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Fixing mobile repository filter wrapping in DashboardView.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Fix mobile filter wrapping in DashboardView.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "replace_file_content"
    }
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1448733"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Improve Kanban board column widths and remove mid-theme-transition background lag in TaskListView.tsx\", \"EndLine\":518, \"Instruction\":\"Use a spacious responsive grid for Kanban columns and clean light/dark card classes in TaskListView.tsx\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"      ) : (\\n        /* Kanban Board View */\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\\\">\\n          {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\\n            const colTasks = filteredTasks.filter((t) => t.status === colStatus);\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={colStatus}\\n                className=\\\"flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-3.5 min-h-[260px]\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                    {colStatus}\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    {colTasks.length}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\\\">\\n                  {colTasks.length === 0 ? (\\n                    <div className=\\\"h-24 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 border border-dashed border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                      No tasks in {colStatus}\\n                    </div>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    colTasks.map((task) => {\\n                      const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\\n                      const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\\n                      return (\\n                        <div\\n                          key={task.id}\\n                          className=\\\"p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 space-y-2\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                              {task.taskCode}\\n                            </span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap\\\">{task.priority}</span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <button\\n                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                            onClick={() => onOpenTask(task.id)}\\n                            className=\\\"text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 line-clamp-2 block\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            {task.title}\\n                          </button>\\n                          {firstRepo && prog && (\\n                            <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"truncate text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                {firstRepo.repositoryName} \302\267 <span className=\\\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\">{firstRepo.workingBranch}</span>\\n                              </div>\\n                              <div className=\\\"mt-1 text-[10px] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                Git: {prog.completedCount}/{prog.applicableCount} ({prog.percent}%)\\n                              </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                          )}\\n                          <div className=\\\"pt-1\\\">\\n                            <select\\n                              aria-label={`Move ${task.taskCode} to status`}\\n                              value={task.status}\\n                              onChange={(e) =>\\n                                onUpdateTaskStatus(task.id, e.target.value as TaskStatus)\\n                              }\\n                              className=\\\"w-full px-2 py-1 text-[11px] rounded border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\"\\n                            >\\n                              {ALL_STATUSES.map((st) => (\\n                                <option key={st} value={st}>\\n                                  Move: {st}\\n                                </option>\\n                              ))}\\n                            </select>\\n                          </div>\\n                        </div>\\n                      );\\n                    })\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n      )}\", \"StartLine\":445, \"TargetContent\":\"      ) : (\\n        /* Kanban Board View */\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-7 gap-3 overflow-x-auto pb-2\\\">\\n          {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\\n            const colTasks = filteredTasks.filter((t) => t.status === colStatus);\\n            return (\\n              <div\\n                key={colStatus}\\n                className=\\\"flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-slate-100/70 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-3 min-h-[420px]\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                    {colStatus}\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-500\\\">\\n                    {colTasks.length}\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\\\">\\n                  {colTasks.map((task) => {\\n                    const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\\n                    const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\\n                    return (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={task.id}\\n                        className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 transition-colors space-y-2\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\">\\n                            {task.taskCode}\\n                          </span>\\n                          <span>{task.priority}</span>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <button\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => onOpenTask(task.id)}\\n                          className=\\\"text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 line-clamp-2\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          {task.title}\\n                        </button>\\n                        {firstRepo && prog && (\\n                          <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                            <div className=\\\"truncate text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                              {firstRepo.repositoryName}\\n