  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":1,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:16:51Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nBuild a polished personal developer task tracker called \342\200\234MIHIR Workspace\342\200\235 for my daily work on the Ray project.\\n\\nCreate the application inside a folder named MIHIR within the selected workspace. If that folder already exists, inspect it and preserve existing work.\\n\\nI need a working application with persistent storage, clean navigation, and a complete task management flow\342\200\224not just a static UI mockup.\\n\\n1. PURPOSE\\n\\nThis website is my personal work journal and task tracker.\\n\\nFor every task \\n<truncated 11522 bytes>\\nions.\\n\\nMake sensible implementation decisions and complete the application. Prioritize a reliable daily workflow and a polished interface.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-21T05:16:51-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-4ie3zr2xna757s2dzruwu2-757652478013.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-4ie3zr2xna757s2dzruwu2-757652478013.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: rathodmihir1113@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":2,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:16:51Z\",\"input_tokens\":23461,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":354,\"thinking\":\"**Initiating Project Definition**\\n\\nI\'m starting by establishing the project\'s parameters. I need to build \\\"MIHIR Workspace,\\\" a developer task tracker, specifically for Ray project work. This application should reside in a \\\"MIHIR\\\" folder within the selected workspace. This sets the foundation for a focused development effort.\\n\\n\\n**Assessing Folder Interaction**\\n\\nI\'m now considering how to handle an existing \\\"MIHIR\\\" folder. My plan is to inspect it and preserve any pre-existing work. Beyond that, I need to focus on delivering a functional application with persistent storage, navigation, and a complete task management workflow, going beyond a mere mockup. My focus will be on delivering functionality, but not at the expense of UI/UX.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking ultra-mode instructions\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ultra mode skill\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":4,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:16:55Z\",\"input_tokens\":5342,\"cache_read_tokens\":23603,\"output_tokens\":76,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking computer-use instructions\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View computer use skill\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":6,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"CANCELED\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:16:57Z\",\"thinking\":\"**Defining the Scope**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the user\'s specific requirements. The primary goal is a polished task tracker, \\\"MIHIR Workspace,\\\" custom-built for Ray project work. I\'m focusing on the name, its folder location, and the preservation of existing content, if any. The creation will happen in a folder named MIHIR inside the selected workspace.\\n\\n\\n\"}\n{\"step_index\":8,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:17:18Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nuse arnon modal \\n\\nBuild a polished personal developer task tracker called \342\200\234MIHIR Workspace\342\200\235 for my daily work on the Ray project.\\n\\nCreate the application inside a folder named MIHIR within the selected workspace. If that folder already exists, inspect it and preserve existing work.\\n\\nI need a working application with persistent storage, clean navigation, and a complete task management flow\342\200\224not just a static UI mockup.\\n\\n1. PURPOSE\\n\\nThis website is my personal work journal and task tracker\\n<truncated 11538 bytes>\\nations.\\n\\nMake sensible implementation decisions and complete the application. Prioritize a reliable daily workflow and a polished interface.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-21T05:17:18-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-4-argon\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-4ie3zr2xna757s2dzruwu2-757652478013.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-4ie3zr2xna757s2dzruwu2-757652478013.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: rathodmihir1113@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":9,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:17:18Z\",\"input_tokens\":36923,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":169,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading frontend-design skill guidelines\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read frontend-design skill\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/package.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Inspecting package.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View package.json\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking workspace root directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List root directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":13,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:17:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":12089,\"cache_read_tokens\":36924,\"output_tokens\":187,\"thinking\":\"**Initiating File Review**\\n\\nI\'m currently reviewing the mandatory domain reference file `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md` using the `view_file` command, per the frontend-design skill\'s requirements. I\'m also looking into the level of SQLite support in Node.js, trying to determine the best approach for the task.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading SaaS dashboard design reference\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read SaaS dashboard reference\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":15,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:17:35Z\",\"input_tokens\":2143,\"cache_read_tokens\":49014,\"output_tokens\":1754,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Prompt Requirements**\\n\\nI\'m currently dissecting the prompt requirements, focusing on the \\\"ultra-mode\\\" stipulations, to formulate a solid verification plan. I\'m starting by mapping out the verification journeys, specifically outlining the core tasks and their expected behavior within the `ultra-mode` context. My goal is to create a detailed verification plan, covering all required journeys and their steps. I plan to refine the verification plan during the next iteration, making sure it addresses \\n<truncated 2988 bytes>\\nN bundle with base64 encoded data) and restore functionalities.\\n\\n\\n**Structuring Project Components**\\n\\nI\'m now determining the optimal project structure. I\'m evaluating two primary approaches: either integrating the core backend and database directly within the root, or encapsulating the full project within the `/MIHIR/` directory, while the root server mounts and serves the app on port 3000. I need to make sure this facilitates both the AI Studio preview and the end user requirements for the deliverable.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"node -v && node --no-warnings -e \\\\\\\"import(\'node:sqlite\').then(m => console.log(\'SQLite available:\', !!m.DatabaseSync))\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking Node version and built-in SQLite support\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check Node SQLite support\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":18,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:18:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":2081,\"cache_read_tokens\":51158,\"output_tokens\":1266,\"thinking\":\"**Discovering Built-In Database**\\n\\nI\'m excited to share a major breakthrough: `node:sqlite` is now my primary database! This built-in module means no more native compilation headaches or external dependencies. My data is neatly stored in an SQLite file at `MIHIR/data/mihir_workspace.sqlite`, and attachments reside in the `MIHIR/uploads` directory. It\'s a clean, efficient solution.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Set application name and description in metadata.json\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"6\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update name and description for MIHIR Workspace\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"MIHIR Workspace\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Personal developer task tracker, engineering investigation journal, multi-repository Git workflow stepper, and work log for the Ray project.\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"requestFramePermissions\\\\\\\": [],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"majorCapabil\\n<truncated 58 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"requestFramePermissions\\\\\\\": [],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"majorCapabilities\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\\\\\\\"]\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/metadata.json\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating metadata.json with app name and description\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update metadata.json\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update index.html with title, meta tags, and Google Fonts (Plus Jakarta Sans, DM Sans, JetBrains Mono)\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"18\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update title, meta description, OpenGraph tags, and include Google Fonts in index.html\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"<!doctype html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\">\\\\n  <head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\\\\\"UTF-8\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <title>MIHIR Workspace \342\200\224 Personal Developer Task Tracker & Engineering Journal</title>\\\\n\\n<truncated 1235 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"<!doctype html>\\\\n<html lang=\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\">\\\\n  <head>\\\\n    <meta charset=\\\\\\\"UTF-8\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"viewport\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\\\\\" />\\\\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\\\\n    <meta name=\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\" content=\\\\\\\"An applic\\n<truncated 464 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/index.html\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating index.html with title, meta tags, and fonts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update index.html\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":21,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:18:26Z\",\"input_tokens\":2258,\"cache_read_tokens\":53240,\"output_tokens\":3992,\"thinking\":\"**Defining Core Architecture**\\n\\nI\'m focusing now on outlining the core components of the system. I want to ensure the design is clean, specifically addressing logic, data types, validation routines, date/timezone management (with an `Asia/Kolkata` default), and precise date formats. I\'m also planning the Git workflow readiness calculation, dashboard metric aggregations, search/filter/sort capabilities, and backup/restore functionality.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Implementation Strategy**\\n\\nI\'ve decided to house validation\\n<truncated 2500 bytes>\\ntypes. I am making sure that I handle all the key attributes for each entry.\\n\\n\\n**Cataloging Project and Repo Data**\\n\\nI\'m working on defining `ProjectConfig`, `RepositoryConfig`, and `WorkspaceSettings` now. I\'m focusing on attributes like project names, repository details (paths, URLs, branches, cloud targets, and workflow modes), theme, timezone, and settings for cloud target labels and workflow mode. I\'m also specifying attachment size limits, required completion checks, tags, and active timer details.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"export type TaskStatus =\\\\n  | \'Backlog\'\\\\n  | \'Assigned\'\\\\n  | \'In Progress\'\\\\n  | \'Blocked\'\\\\n  | \'Ready for Testing\'\\\\n  | \'In Review\'\\\\n  | \'Done\';\\\\n\\\\nexport type TaskPriority = \'Low\' | \'Medium\' | \'High\' | \'Urgent\';\\\\n\\\\nexport type ChangeType = \'Added\' | \'Mod\\n<truncated 5715 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create TypeScript domain types for MIHIR Workspace inside MIHIR/src/types/workspace.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/types/workspace.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating domain types in MIHIR/src/types/workspace.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create workspace domain types\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":23,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:19:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":4116,\"cache_read_tokens\":55499,\"output_tokens\":6599,\"thinking\":\"**Defining Git Stages**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on defining the Git stages within the `workspaceLogic.ts` module. Specifically, I\'m working on the `createDefaultGitStages` function to generate the structured workflow stages. I\'m considering parameters like base and working branches, as well as the dev target branch, the cloud target name, and workflow mode. This will produce 14 stages of Git workflow logic.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Data Computations**\\n\\nI\'m now deep in the computational logic. I am finalizing functions to format timestamps for clarity, evaluate task readiness accurately by factoring in \'Blocked\' states, and compute dashboard metrics from task data. I am refining the filtering and sorting of task lists to support numerous search and filter criteria.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import {\\\\n  GitWorkflowStage,\\\\n  RequiredCompletionChecks,\\\\n  TaskPriority,\\\\n  TaskRecord,\\\\n  TaskStatus,\\\\n  TimeEntry,\\\\n  WorkflowMode,\\\\n} from \'../types/workspace\';\\\\n\\\\nexport const DEFAULT_GIT_STAGE_BLUEPRINTS: Array<{\\\\n  stageKey: string;\\\\n  stepNumber\\n<truncated 20843 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create pure domain logic functions in MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating domain logic in MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create workspace logic module\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":25,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:20:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":6719,\"cache_read_tokens\":59616,\"output_tokens\":2674,\"thinking\":\"**Initiating Unit Tests**\\n\\nI\'m now in the process of implementing the unit test suite, `/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts`. I\'m utilizing `node:test` and `node:assert/strict` as per the `ultra-mode` specifications. The file creation is underway.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import test from \'node:test\';\\\\nimport assert from \'node:assert/strict\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  createDefaultGitStages,\\\\n  evaluateTaskReadiness,\\\\n  computeDashboardMetrics,\\\\n  filterAndSortTasks,\\\\n  formatUnambiguousDate,\\\\n  summarizeRepositoryProgress,\\\\n} from \'./\\n<truncated 7911 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create unit tests for MIHIR Workspace core logic in MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Writing unit tests for workspace logic\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create workspace logic unit tests\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":27,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:20:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":2796,\"cache_read_tokens\":66336,\"output_tokens\":15637,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing Database Layer**\\n\\nI\'m now focused on building the SQLite database layer and seeding the sample dataset within `/MIHIR/server/`. I need to ensure the sample data precisely covers the four illustrative tasks outlined, starting with `MIHIR-001`, which involves reordering Grafana security panels in the `raydashboard` project, specifically within the `RAY-MIHIR-Security` branch. I\'ll focus on these initial tasks.\\n\\n\\n**Expanding Task Scope**\\n\\nI\'ve expanded the scope to include three more illustrative tasks. I\'m now tackling `MIHIR-002`, `MIHIR-003`, and `MIHIR-004`, across multiple repositories. Specifically, I am focused on improving graph loading in `raydashboard` and `rayhubapp`, adding an SSL/TLS dropdown across `raydashboard` and `rayhubapp`, and updating placeholder mappings in `rayjobapp` and `rayhubapp`. I\'m also planning to generate before/after SVG/PNG diagram screenshots for a persistent file system representation.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import fs from \'node:fs\';\\\\nimport path from \'node:path\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  ActivityItem,\\\\n  ProjectConfig,\\\\n  RepositoryConfig,\\\\n  TaskRecord,\\\\n  TimeEntry,\\\\n  WorkNote,\\\\n  WorkspaceSettings,\\\\n} from \'../src/types/workspace\';\\\\nimport { createDefaultGitStages }\\n<truncated 48902 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create seed data and sample SVG upload assets in MIHIR/server/seedAssets.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/seedAssets.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating seed data and sample upload assets\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create seedAssets.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":29,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:23:30Z\",\"input_tokens\":15757,\"cache_read_tokens\":69133,\"output_tokens\":4957,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing The Persistence Layer**\\n\\nI\'m now implementing the SQLite persistence layer using `node:sqlite` in `/MIHIR/server/db.ts`, focusing on initializing relational tables for `tasks`, `projects`, `repositories`, `time_entries`, `activity_log`, and `work_notes`. I\'m ensuring proper database setup for efficient data management.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import fs from \'node:fs\';\\\\nimport path from \'node:path\';\\\\nimport { DatabaseSync } from \'node:sqlite\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  ActivityItem,\\\\n  DuplicatePolicy,\\\\n  ProjectConfig,\\\\n  RepositoryConfig,\\\\n  TaskRecord,\\\\n  TimeEntry,\\\\n  WorkNote,\\\\n  WorkspaceSettings,\\\\n  \\n<truncated 15689 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create SQLite database persistence and backup/restore engine in MIHIR/server/db.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/db.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating SQLite database module in MIHIR/server/db.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create SQLite persistence layer\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":31,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:24:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":5075,\"cache_read_tokens\":84891,\"output_tokens\":8110,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing API Infrastructure**\\n\\nI\'m now building out the Express API router, specifically `/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts`, along with the root `/server.ts`. This configuration will seamlessly integrate a REST API with static file serving from `/uploads` and a Vite frontend dev server, all running on port 3000. My focus at the moment is to ensure robust API endpoints, including `GET /api/`.\\n\\n\\n**Defining API Endpoints**\\n\\nI\'ve specified the API endpoints. Now I have a clear outline for creating, updating, du\\n<truncated 372 bytes>\\n\'s capabilities. I\'m implementing endpoints for projects, repositories, time entries, work notes, and settings modifications using `POST`, `PUT`, and `DELETE`. I\'ve also added a timer with start/stop functionalities. Crucially, it persists the active timer state in SQLite, preventing duplicates. I\'m also including backup and restore functionality, with export returning a `BackupBundle` and import handling validation and duplicate policies. I\'ll focus on crafting the `/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts` file now.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import express from \'express\';\\\\nimport fs from \'node:fs\';\\\\nimport path from \'node:path\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  createCompleteBackupBundle,\\\\n  deleteProjectById,\\\\n  deleteRepositoryById,\\\\n  deleteTaskById,\\\\n  deleteTimeEntryById,\\\\n  deleteWorkNoteById,\\\\n  getAllRep\\n<truncated 25068 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create Express REST API router in MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Express API router in MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Express API router\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":33,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:25:40Z\",\"input_tokens\":8228,\"cache_read_tokens\":89967,\"output_tokens\":889,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing Server Files**\\n\\nI\'m now building out the `/server.ts` file at the workspace root, alongside a corresponding launcher at `/MIHIR/server/index.ts`. I\'m also revising `/package.json` to ensure that `npm run dev` executes `tsx server.ts` on port 3000. It will serve `/api/*` and `/uploads/*` directories from `/MIHIR/`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import express from \'express\';\\\\nimport path from \'node:path\';\\\\nimport fs from \'node:fs\';\\\\nimport { createServer as createViteServer } from \'vite\';\\\\nimport { apiRouter } from \'./MIHIR/server/apiRouter\';\\\\nimport { UPLOADS_DIR } from \'./MIHIR/server/db\';\\\\n\\\\n\\n<truncated 1114 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create full-stack Express + Vite server entry point in server.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/server.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating server.ts entry point\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create server.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update package.json scripts to run full-stack server.ts on port 3000\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"13\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update dev and start scripts in package.json to run tsx server.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  \\\\\\\"scripts\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"dev\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tsx server.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"start\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tsx server.ts\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"build\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"vite build\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"preview\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"vite preview\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"clean\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"rm -rf dist server.js\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"lint\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tsc --noEmit\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"test\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"tsx --tes\\n<truncated 47 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"6\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  \\\\\\\"scripts\\\\\\\": {\\\\n    \\\\\\\"dev\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"vite --port=3000 --host=0.0.0.0\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\