n E, focusing on the finer details of the attachment module. I\'m thinking through advanced features such as file management. I\'m working on drag-and-drop uploads, and the onPaste functionality. I\'m also planning the thumbnails gallery and full-size image zoom. I have to design Before/After side-by-side comparisons to include in Section E.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Upload,\\\\n  ZoomIn,\\\\n  ZoomOut,\\\\n  X,\\\\n  Trash2,\\\\n  Edit3,\\\\n  Columns2,\\\\n  ClipboardPaste,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  Image as ImageIcon,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  AttachmentCategory,\\\\n  TaskAttach\\n<truncated 34336 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create TaskAttachmentsSection component with upload, drag-drop, clipboard paste, zoom modal, and Before/After comparison in MIHIR/src/components/TaskAttachmentsSection.tsx\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskAttachmentsSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating TaskAttachmentsSection.tsx component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create TaskAttachmentsSection.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":47,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:35:11Z\",\"input_tokens\":3073,\"cache_read_tokens\":135966,\"output_tokens\":6891,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the Workflow Section**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m diving into the implementation of `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx`. My current focus is ensuring this component aligns perfectly with Section 7\'s requirements. Specifically, I\'m working to make sure it includes the configurable visual workflow for each repository, and I am on track to incorporate all 14 required stages.\\n\\n\\n**Refining Task Completion**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the \\\"Task Completion Readiness Gate\\\" within the workflow component. I\342\200\231m focusing on ensuring it clearly outlines all outstanding checks required before a task can be finalized. The distinction between manual records and verified integrations is also receiving careful attention to ensure full clarity, preventing any misinterpretation. My goal is to make the distinction between local/remote actions easy to distinguish with the implementation of summary cards.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  GitBranch,\\\\n  GitCommit,\\\\n  GitMerge,\\\\n  CloudUpload,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  AlertTriangle,\\\\n  ExternalLink,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  ShieldCheck,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  GitStageStatus,\\\\n  GitW\\n<truncated 24400 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create TaskGitWorkflowSection component with 14-stage stepper and delivery readiness gate in MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":49,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:36:24Z\",\"input_tokens\":7014,\"cache_read_tokens\":139040,\"output_tokens\":21046,\"thinking\":\"**Combining Task Detail Elements**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on assembling the `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx` file, integrating the seven distinct sections of the Task Detail Page. I\'m starting by constructing the header bar, incorporating the \\\"Back to tasks\\\" button, task ID, title, status selector, priority selector, and the live timer start/stop functionality.\\n\\n\\n**Adding Task Detail Buttons**\\n\\nI\'ve incorporated the \\\"Export Markdown Report,\\\" \\\"Duplicate,\\\" \\\"Archive/Recover,\\\" and \\\"Delete\\\" buttons into the\\n<truncated 406 bytes>\\na Sections**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into the component structure for individual sections within the Task Detail Page. I\'m focusing on defining the components for \\\"Investigation\\\" by incorporating a clear indicator for saved/unsaved changes and a dedicated \\\"Save Investigation\\\" button. I\'m structuring and organizing fields for changed files to accommodate actions such as adding, editing, and deleting file records, ensuring a one-click copy path button for the file path display. I\'m adding fields for code snippets.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  ArrowLeft,\\\\n  Play,\\\\n  Square,\\\\n  Download,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  Archive,\\\\n  ArchiveRestore,\\\\n  Trash2,\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Save,\\\\n  Eye,\\\\n  Edit3,\\\\n  FolderGit2,\\\\n  FileCode2,\\\\n  FlaskConical,\\\\n  \\n<truncated 79287 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create TaskDetailView component with 7 sections in MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating TaskDetailView.tsx component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":51,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:39:33Z\",\"input_tokens\":21168,\"cache_read_tokens\":146055,\"output_tokens\":11578,\"thinking\":\"**Constructing Navigation Views**\\n\\nI\'m now focused on building the final three primary navigation views. These include a component for managing projects and repositories, one for logging work with daily/weekly summaries and engineering notes, and finally, a settings view. I\'m aiming for clean separation and functionality in these components.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_