"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"# MIHIR Workspace \342\200\224 Personal Developer Task Tracker & Engineering Journal\\\\n\\\\n**MIHIR Workspace** is a personal developer work journal, multi-repository task tracker, and Git/release workflow verification log built for daily engineering work on the **Ray\\n<truncated 2864 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create comprehensive README documentation in MIHIR/README.md\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/README.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating MIHIR/README.md documentation\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create MIHIR/README.md\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"# MIHIR Workspace\\\\n\\\\nSee [`MIHIR/README.md`](./MIHIR/README.md) for full architecture, database & uploads paths (`MIHIR/data/mihir_workspace.sqlite` and `MIHIR/uploads/`), backup/restore instructions, and usage guide.\\\\n\\\\n## Quick Start\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nnpm ins\\n<truncated 25 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create root README.md pointing to MIHIR/README.md\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/README.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating root README.md\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create root README.md\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"# Port for the MIHIR Workspace Express + Vite server\\\\nPORT=3000\\\\n\\\\n# Optional override for data directory (defaults to ./MIHIR/data and ./MIHIR/uploads)\\\\nMIHIR_DATA_DIR=\\\\\\\"./MIHIR/data\\\\\\\"\\\\nMIHIR_UPLOADS_DIR=\\\\\\\"./MIHIR/uploads\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\"\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create example environment configuration in MIHIR/.env.example\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/.env.example\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating MIHIR/.env.example\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create MIHIR/.env.example\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":64,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:44:13Z\",\"input_tokens\":2147,\"cache_read_tokens\":193913,\"output_tokens\":1176,\"thinking\":\"**Initiating Verification Process**\\n\\nI\'m now initiating the verification round as per `ultra-mode`. I\'ve begun with the unit tests using `tsx` on `MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts`. Concurrently, I\'m developing an integration test focused on the SQLite database and its backup/restore engine, targeting `MIHIR/server`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import test from \'node:test\';\\\\nimport assert from \'node:assert/strict\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  createCompleteBackupBundle,\\\\n  getAllTasks,\\\\n  getFullWorkspaceState,\\\\n  getTaskById,\\\\n  restoreFromBackupBundle,\\\\n  upsertTask,\\\\n} from \'./db\';\\\\nimport { createDefaultGi\\n<truncated 2884 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create SQLite persistence and backup/restore unit test in MIHIR/server/db.test.ts\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/db.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating SQLite persistence test MIHIR/server/db.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create db.test.ts\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":66,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:44:28Z\",\"input_tokens\":3345,\"cache_read_tokens\":194011,\"output_tokens\":2113,\"thinking\":\"**Executing Unit Tests**\\n\\nI\'m currently running the unit tests using the `run_command` function on the specified files: `MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts` and `MIHIR/server/db.test.ts`. After the tests complete, I\'ll clean up the temporary `test-persist` task. I\'m also preparing to update `MIHIR/server/db.test.ts`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Clean up temporary test task at the end of db.test.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"102\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Import deleteTaskById and remove testId af