a test activity entry needs removal from the engineering activity timeline. Before correcting those issues, let\'s run interactive journeys to confirm these UI issues.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\\\n    // 1. Click into MIHIR-001 or MIHIR-003 Screenshots & Attachmen\\n<truncated 1105 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running interactive journeys across Task Detail, Attachments, Git Stepper, Kanban, and Light Theme\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run interactive browser journeys\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":83,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:46:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":2688,\"cache_read_tokens\":204461,\"output_tokens\":243,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r1-task-attachments.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing task attachments & Before/After comparison screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r1-task-attachments.png\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r1-task-git.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing task Git & Release workflow stepper screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r1-task-git.png\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r1-tasks-kanban-light.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Kanban board in Light theme screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r1-tasks-kanban-light.png\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":87,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:47:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":3809,\"cache_read_tokens\":207150,\"output_tokens\":4945,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Visual Defects**\\n\\nI\'ve zeroed in on the initial visual defect: a high-severity contrast issue within `r` captures under the light theme. I\'m prioritizing outlining the most significant problems first, starting with concrete fixes. The \'ultra-mode\' visual verification has proven quite valuable. Now it\'s time to refine this initial assessment for clarity.\\n\\n\\n**Investigating Theme Inconsistency**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into the light theme rendering issues. Specifically, I\'m tracing the dark backgrounds on\\n<truncated 1886 bytes>\\n theme changes are instantaneous.\\n\\n\\n**Optimizing UI Layout**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on layout issues. I\'ve pinpointed two specific problems. First, the tab labels in the sidebar are causing horizontal overflow on a 1440px viewport when the sidebar is expanded. I\'m going to shorten the labels and use compact padding or flex-wrap to ensure all seven tabs fit without clipping. Secondly, the mobile repository filter in `DashboardView.tsx` is overflowing horizontally at 390px width. I\'ll use `flex-wrap` here, too.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Allow repository filter buttons on Dashboard to wrap cleanly on mobile viewports\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"218\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add flex-wrap to the repository segmented control container in DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"          <div className=\\\\\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 max-w-full\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <button\\\\n              type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\"\\\\n              onClick={() => setSel\\n<truncated 1108 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"188\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"          <div className=\\\\\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <button\\\\n              type=\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\"\\\\n              onClick={() => setSelectedRepo(\'All\')}\\\\n  \\n<truncated 1123 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Fixing mobile repository filter wrapping in DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Fix mobile filter wrapping in DashboardView.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Improve Kanban board column widths and remove mid-theme-transition background lag in TaskListView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"518\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Use a spacious responsive grid for Kanban columns and clean light/dark card classes in TaskListView.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"      ) : (\\\\n        /* Kanban Board View */\\\\n        <div className=\\\\\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\\\\\\\">\\\\n          {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\\\\n            const colTasks = filteredTasks.filter((t) => t.st\\n<truncated 4411 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"445\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"      ) : (\\\\n        /* Kanban Board View */\\\\n        <div className=\\\\\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-7 gap-3 overflow-x-auto pb-2\\\\\\\">\\\\n          {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\\\\n            const colTasks = filteredTasks.fi\\n<truncated 4017 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Improving Kanban layout and card contrast in TaskListView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Improve Kanban board in TaskListView.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":90,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:48:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":7878,\"cache_read_tokens\":210960,\"output_tokens\":3093,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing CSS Specificity**\\n\\nI\'m currently investigating why a Kanban card remained dark, even without the `.dark` class on the `<html>` tag. My focus is now on `src/index.css`. Specifically, I\'m examining how `@custom-variant dark` is implemented and how it impacts the CSS specificity within the context of the HTML structure and associated classes. I will have to look closely at the selectors!\\n\\n\\n**Investigating Style Conflicts**\\n\\nI\'m now tracing the style issue back to the `index.html` file, specifically\\n<truncated 1550 bytes>\\nies**\\n\\nI\'m now zeroing in on the asynchronous nature of the theme toggle function. I\'m focusing on why Playwright\'s `.click()` doesn\'t wait for the `fetch(\'/api/settings\')` request to complete. The inconsistency in screenshots is puzzling, especially considering the timing of the transition colors. I\'m considering scenarios where the screenshot captures the page during the transition. I will focus on `TaskDetailView.tsx` and `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx` next. I will examine why the page could be partly white.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Make TaskDetailView tabs wrap cleanly with concise labels so all 7 tabs are always visible without clipping\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"470\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Shorten tab labels and use flex-wrap on the tablist in TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  const TABS: Array<{ id: TaskDetailTab; label: string; count?: number }> = [\\\\n    { id: \'overview\', label: \'Overview & Workspace\', count: task.repositories.length },\\\\n    { id: \'investigation\', label: \'Investigation\' },\\\\n    { id: \'files\', label: \'Change\\n<truncated 323 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"322\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  const TABS: Array<{ id: TaskDetailTab; label: string; count?: number }> = [\\\\n    { id: \'overview\', label: \'A/B. Overview & Workspace\', count: task.repositories.length },\\\\n    { id: \'investigation\', label: \'C. Problem & Investigation\' },\\\\n    { id: \'file\\n<truncated 394 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Making TaskDetailView tab labels concise\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update tab labels in TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Allow task detail tabs to wrap cleanly without horizontal clipping\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"495\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Use flex-wrap on the tablist container in TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"        {/* Navigation Tabs inside Task Detail */}\\\\n        <div\\\\n          role=\\\\\\\"tablist\\\\\\\"\\\\n          aria-label=\\\\\\\"Task detail sections\\\\\\\"\\\\n          className=\\\\\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\n<truncated 716 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"455\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"        {/* Navigation Tabs inside Task Detail */}\\\\n        <div\\\\n          role=\\\\\\\"tablist\\\\\\\"\\\\n          aria-label=\\\\\\\"Task detail sections\\\\\\\"\\\\n          className=\\\\\\\"flex items-center gap-1 overflow-x-auto pt-2 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\n<truncated 738 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating tablist container to flex-wrap in TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update tablist layout in TaskDetailView.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Apply theme change synchronously on click in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"160\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update handleToggleTheme in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx to apply theme immediately before API call\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  const handleToggleTheme = async () => {\\\\n    const nextTheme = currentTheme === \'dark\' ? \'light\' : \'dark\';\\\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'mihir_theme\', nextTheme);\\\\n    const root = document.documentElement;\\\\n    if (nextTheme === \'dark\') {\\\\n      root.clas\\n<truncated 394 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"138\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  const handleToggleTheme = async () => {\\\\n    const nextTheme = currentTheme === \'dark\' ? \'light\' : \'dark\';\\\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'mihir_theme\', nextTheme);\\\\n    await apiRequest(\\\\n      \'/api/settings\',\\\\n      {\\\\n        method: \'PUT\',\\\\n        body\\n<truncated 104 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating handleToggleTheme for instant theme switching\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update handleToggleTheme in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":94,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:48:58Z\",\"input_tokens\":4567,\"cache_read_tokens\":218839,\"output_tokens\":758,\"thinking\":\"**Investigating Tailwind Issues**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into `src/index.css`. The main point is to confirm Tailwind v4 explicitly scans `/MIHIR/src` using `@source \\\"../MIHIR/src\\\";`. I have another pressing matter at hand: figuring out why `bg-white dark:bg-slate-900` is behaving oddly in some `/MIHIR/src/` classes.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add explicit @source directive for MIHIR/src in src/index.css\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"4\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add @source \\\\\\\"../MIHIR/src\\\\\\\"; to src/index.css\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"@import \\\\\\\"tailwindcss\\\\\\\";\\\\n@source \\\\\\\"../MIHIR/src\\\\\\\";\\\\n\\\\n@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"@import \\\\\\\"tailwindcss\\\\\\\";\\\\n\\\\n@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding @source \\\\\\\"../MIHIR/src\\\\\\\" to src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add @source to src/index.css\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Ensure db.test.ts cleans up any test activity log entry so the workspace activity timeline remains pristine\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"101\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Remove the test restore activity log entry in db.test.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  const restoreRes = restoreFromBackupBundle(bundle, \'skip\');\\\\n  assert.equal(restoreRes.importedTasks, 0);\\\\n  assert.ok(restoreRes.skippedTasks >= 5);\\\\n\\\\n  deleteTaskById(testId);\\\\n  const state = getFullWorkspaceState();\\\\n  assert.ok(state.storageInfo.d\\n<truncated 65 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"89\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  const restoreRes = restoreFromBackupBundle(bundle, \'skip\');\\\\n  assert.equal(restoreRes.importedTasks, 0);\\\\n  assert.ok(restoreRes.skippedTasks >= 5);\\\\n\\\\n  deleteTaskById(testId);\\\\n\\\\n  const state = getFullWorkspaceState();\\\\n  assert.ok(state.storageInfo\\n<truncated 67 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/db.test.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating db.test.ts cleanup\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update db.test.ts cleanup\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":97,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:49:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":2168,\"cache_read_tokens\":222501,\"output_tokens\":288,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying App Functionality**\\n\\nI\'ve just initiated Round 2 verification. I started by executing unit tests across the workspace logic and database components. The next step involves compiling the applet. After this, I plan to restart the development server. Finally, I will carefully capture and inspect the desktop, mobile, task detail tabs, and Kanban Light theme for any discrepancies.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"./node_modules/.bin/tsx --test MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts MIHIR/server/db.test.ts\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running unit tests after Round 1 fixes\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run unit tests\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet after Round 1 fixes\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet\\\"\",\"waitForPreviousTools\":\"true\"}},{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server for Round 2 verification\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart dev server\\\"\",\"waitForPreviousTools\":\"true\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":102,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:49:35Z\",\"input_tokens\":3251,\"cache_read_tokens\":222620,\"output_tokens\":554,\"thinking\":\"**Verifying Round 2 Results**\\n\\nI\'m currently running Round 2 browser verification using `playwright-cli`, specifically focusing on mobile viewport (390x844) repository filter wrapping. I\342\200\231m also checking if Task Detail tabs fit cleanly on 1440px. The visual checks are saved as `.playwright-cli/r2-mobile.png` and `.playwright-cli/r2-1440.png`, respectively.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 390 844 && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r2-mobile.png && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\\\\\n<truncated 803 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running Round 2 browser verification captures\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run Round 2 browser verification\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":104,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:49:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":3035,\"cache_read_tokens\":223822,\"output_tokens\":40,\"content\":\"I am running the second round of browser verification to inspect the mobile layout, task detail tabs, and light/dark theme contrast.\"}\n{\"step_index\":106,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:50:44Z\",\"input_tokens\":2753,\"cache_read_tokens\":224846,\"output_tokens\":232,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-mobile.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Round 2 mobile screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r2-mobile.png\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-task-detail.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Round 2 task detail tabs screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r2-task-detail.png\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-kanban-light.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Round 2 Kanban light theme screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r2-kanban-light.png\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":110,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:51:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":3784,\"cache_read_tokens\":227600,\"output_tokens\":563,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Visuals Progress**\\n\\nI\'ve been meticulously examining the updated visuals, specifically `r2-mobile.png`, `r2-task-detail.png`, and `r2-kanban-light.png`. It\'s a significant leap forward; every defect identified in the first round appears to be entirely resolved. The usability improvements in the repository filter buttons in `r2-mobile.png` are notable. The detailed task view is improved, and the Kanban board feels improved.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000 && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli resize 1440 900 && \\\\\\\\\\\\n  playwright-cli run-code \'async (page) => {\\\\n    await page.getByRole(\\\\\\\"button\\\\\\\", { name: /Projects & Repos/i })\\n<truncated 412 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Verifying Projects & Repos, Work Log, and Settings views in browser\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify Projects, Work Log, and Settings views\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":112,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T12:51:57Z\",\"input_tokens\":2265,\"cache_read_tokens\":230196,\"output_tokens\":219,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-projects.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Projects & Repositories screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r2-projects.png\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-worklog.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Work Log screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r2-worklog.png\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-settings.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Settings & Backup screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View r2-settings.png\\\"\"}}]}"
