 to existing threads, all within the specified framework.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Import chat and daily focus helpers in MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"31\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add imports from ./db and ./geminiChat in MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  upsertProject,\\\\n  upsertRepository,\\\\n  upsertTask,\\\\n  upsertTimeEntry,\\\\n  upsertWorkNote,\\\\n  getAllChatThreads,\\\\n  getChatThreadById,\\\\n  upsertChatThread,\\\\n  deleteChatThreadById,\\\\n  getAllDailyFocusItems,\\\\n  upsertDailyFocusItem,\\\\n  deleteDailyFocusIte\\n<truncated 322 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"21\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  upsertProject,\\\\n  upsertRepository,\\\\n  upsertTask,\\\\n  upsertTimeEntry,\\\\n  upsertWorkNote,\\\\n} from \'./db\';\\\\nimport { createDefaultGitStages } from \'../src/lib/workspaceLogic\';\\\\nimport { DuplicatePolicy, TaskAttachment, TaskRecord, TaskRepository } from \'\\n<truncated 25 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding chat and focus imports in apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add imports in apiRouter.ts\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add Gemini multi-turn chat and daily focus routes to MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"784\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Append /chat and /focus endpoints to MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"apiRouter.post(\'/backup/restore\', (req, res) => {\\\\n  try {\\\\n    const { bundle, duplicatePolicy = \'overwrite\' } = req.body as {\\\\n      bundle: any;\\\\n      duplicatePolicy?: DuplicatePolicy;\\\\n    };\\\\n    const result = restoreFromBackupBundle(bundle, dupli\\n<truncated 5591 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"759\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"apiRouter.post(\'/backup/restore\', (req, res) => {\\\\n  try {\\\\n    const { bundle, duplicatePolicy = \'overwrite\' } = req.body as {\\\\n      bundle: any;\\\\n      duplicatePolicy?: DuplicatePolicy;\\\\n    };\\\\n    const result = restoreFromBackupBundle(bundle, dupli\\n<truncated 188 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding /chat and /focus API routes in apiRouter.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add chat and focus API routes\\\"\",\"waitForPreviousTools\":\"true\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":253,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:30:18Z\",\"input_tokens\":5044,\"cache_read_tokens\":171469,\"output_tokens\":12650,\"thinking\":\"**Developing Frontend Components**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m now focused on the frontend components. Specifically, I\'m building `/MIHIR/src/components/AiCopilotView.tsx`. This view will be the Gemini Engineering Assistant, supporting multiple persistent conversation threads. I\'m aiming for full functionality, including creating, switching, and deleting conversation threads. I\'m also planning a slide-over drawer option for accessibility.\\n\\n\\n**Defining AI Copilot Features**\\n\\nI\'ve been defining the AI Copilot\'s feature set. I\\n<truncated 322 bytes>\\ntion. Finally, I\'m working on quick prompt chips for common engineering tasks, and direct actions to apply investigation.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing Cloud Sync**\\n\\nI\'m now prioritizing the implementation of automatic synchronization to Cloud Firestore. I plan to achieve this by syncing assistant messages in real-time to `chatThreads/{threadId}/messages/{messageId}` whenever the user is signed in with Google. I am building the global command palette using `CommandPaletteModal.tsx`, to improve the developer workflow.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Sparkles,\\\\n  Send,\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Trash2,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  Terminal,\\\\n  Bug,\\\\n  FlaskConical,\\\\n  FileText,\\\\n  CloudCheck,\\\\n  GitBranch,\\\\n  ArrowUpRight,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nim\\n<truncated 28624 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create multi-turn Gemini Engineering Copilot view in MIHIR/src/components/AiCopilotView.tsx\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/AiCopilotView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating AiCopilotView.tsx component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create AiCopilotView.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Search,\\\\n  X,\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Sparkles,\\\\n  Clock,\\\\n  FileText,\\\\n  Sun,\\\\n  Moon,\\\\n  GitBranch,\\\\n  ArrowRight,\\\\n  Copy,\\\\n  Check,\\\\n  CloudUpload,\\\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { TaskDet\\n<truncated 13762 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create keyboard-driven CommandPaletteModal in MIHIR/src/components/CommandPaletteModal.tsx\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/CommandPaletteModal.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating CommandPaletteModal.tsx component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create CommandPaletteModal.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":256,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:32:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":12896,\"cache_read_tokens\":176514,\"output_tokens\":198,\"thinking\":\"**Developing Git Commands**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the `TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx` file. The goal is to generate one-click terminal Git commands automatically. Specifically, when Mihir opens the \\\"Git & Release\\\" section for any task (e.g., MIHIR-001), I\'m working to provide him with expandable and readily copyable bash commands.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"300\",\"StartLine\":\"220\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing repository bar in TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":258,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:33:30Z\",\"input_tokens\":3892,\"cache_read_tokens\":187361,\"output_tokens\":110,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"415\",\"StartLine\":\"350\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Local Folder bar in TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Local Folder bar\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":260,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:33:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":3655,\"cache_read_tokens\":189204,\"output_tokens\":177,\"thinking\":\"**Adding Git Commands Generator**\\n\\nI\'m exploring the feasibility of integrating a \\\"Copy Git Terminal Sequence\\\" button directly into `TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx`, nestled below the repository path and branch metadata. This would provide users with one-click access to Git commands. I intend to place the edits within `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing top of TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View top of TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":262,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:34:09Z\",\"input_tokens\":2442,\"cache_read_tokens\":191364,\"output_tokens\":1585,\"thinking\":\"**Adding Git Commands Button**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the user interface of `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx`. My primary goal is to integrate a user-friendly \\\"Copy Terminal Git Commands\\\" button, coupled with an expandable command reference card, directly beneath the Repository Path & Branch Metadata Bar. This aims to simplify the workflow for users interacting with the Git commands.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add Terminal Git Commands generator and copy helper in TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"396\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add Terminal Git Commands snippet and Copy Commands button in TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"      {/* Repository Path & Branch Metadata Bar */}\\\\n      <div className=\\\\\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 text-xs\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div className=\\\\\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center justif\\n<truncated 2868 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"366\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"      {/* Repository Path & Branch Metadata Bar */}\\\\n      <div className=\\\\\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div classN\\n<truncated 1551 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding Copy Terminal Git Commands button to TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add Copy Terminal Git Commands button\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":264,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:34:28Z\",\"input_tokens\":3239,\"cache_read_tokens\":193807,\"output_tokens\":182,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing DashboardView.tsx**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into `DashboardView.tsx`. The goal is to integrate a \\\"Today\'s Daily Focus Checklist & Standup Bar\\\". This feature will load from `/api/focus`, allowing for dynamic management of daily sprint focus items. I also plan to add \\\"Copy Standup Report\\\" and \\\"Open AI Copilot\\\" one-click features. Finally, I\'ll be integrating Cloud Firestore.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"170\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing top of DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View DashboardView.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":266,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:34:42Z\",\"input_tokens\":2718,\"cache_read_tokens\":197047,\"output_tokens\":126,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"260\",\"StartLine\":\"171\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing DashboardView filter bar and KPI cards\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View DashboardView filter bar\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":268,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:34:53Z\",\"input_tokens\":2050,\"cache_read_tokens\":199766,\"output_tokens\":6596,\"thinking\":\"**Adding Dashboard Enhancements**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the `DashboardView.tsx` component. I\'m adding optional props for `onOpenAiCopilot` and `onCopyStandup` functionalities. Additionally, I\'m integrating a dynamic \\\"Daily Engineering Focus & Standup Strip,\\\" which will interact with `/api/focus` to allow for task completion tracking.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add Daily Focus checklist and AI Copilot quick actions to DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"193\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add DailyFocus state, handlers, and Daily Focus & Standup Strip to DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Clock,\\\\n  FileText,\\\\n  Play,\\\\n  Square,\\\\n  GitBranch,\\\\n  AlertTriangle,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  ArrowRight,\\\\n  Trash2,\\\\n  RotateCcw,\\\\n  FileCode2,\\\\n  Image as ImageIcon,\\\\n  Fla\\n<truncated 14065 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Clock,\\\\n  FileText,\\\\n  Play,\\\\n  Square,\\\\n  GitBranch,\\\\n  AlertTriangle,\\\\n  CheckCircle2,\\\\n  ArrowRight,\\\\n  Trash2,\\\\n  RotateCcw,\\\\n  FileCode2,\\\\n  Image as ImageIcon,\\\\n  FlaskConical,\\\\\\n<truncated 6754 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/components/DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding Daily Engineering Focus checklist and AI Copilot buttons to DashboardView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update DashboardView.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":270,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:36:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":9629,\"cache_read_tokens\":201817,\"output_tokens\":426,\"thinking\":\"**Examining Component Integration**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx` to integrate Firebase authentication and Cloud Firestore synchronization. I\'m focusing on `onAuthStateChanged` to track the `firebaseUser` state. I\'ll connect the \\\"Sign in with Google\\\" button in the top bar or sidebar using `signInWithGoogle`. I\'m starting from the perspective of an expert, so I\'m aiming for clean and efficient integration.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing top of MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View top of MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"896\",\"StartLine\":\"460\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing navigation and main layout in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View layout in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":273,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:36:33Z\",\"input_tokens\":9123,\"cache_read_tokens\":211447,\"output_tokens\":155,\"thinking\":\"**Examining Code Handlers**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on `/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`, specifically lines 140-460. I\'m reviewing the various handlers there, such as `handleCreateTask`, `handleUpdateTask`, and others. The goal is to determine how to automatically sync with Firestore whenever a user signs in.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"460\",\"StartLine\":\"140\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing handlers in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View handlers in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":275,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-21T13:36:42Z\",\"input_tokens\":4339,\"cache_read_tokens\":220571,\"output_tokens\":19887,\"thinking\":\"**Integrating Firebase Auth & Firestore**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on integrating Firebase Auth and Cloud Firestore within `/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`. I\'m starting by implementing the authentication methods (`onAuthStateChanged`, `signInWithGooglePopup`, `signOutFirebaseUser`) and then moving on to data synchronization with Firestore, specifically focusing on tasks, work notes, and time entries.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Integrate Firebase Auth, Cloud Firestore sync, AI Copilot, and Command Palette in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"250\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add imports, state, Firebase Auth listener, and Firestore sync hooks in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  LayoutDashboard,\\\\n  CheckSquare,\\\\n  FolderGit2,\\\\n  Clock,\\\\n  Settings,\\\\n  PanelLeftClose,\\\\n  PanelLeftOpen,\\\\n  Search,\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Sun,\\\\n  Moon,\\\\n  Square,\\\\n  Menu,\\\\n  \\n<truncated 11870 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useCallback, useEffect, useMemo, useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport {\\\\n  LayoutDashboard,\\\\n  CheckSquare,\\\\n  FolderGit2,\\\\n  Clock,\\\\n  Settings,\\\\n  PanelLeftClose,\\\\n  PanelLeftOpen,\\\\n  Search,\\\\n  Plus,\\\\n  Sun,\\\\n  Moon,\\\\n  Square,\\\\n  Menu,\\\\n  \\n<truncated 6963 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx with Firebase Auth and Copilot state\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx state and handlers\\\"\"}},{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Wire AI Copilot view, Command Palette, and Google Sign-In UI in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"1032\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update NAV_ITEMS, sidebar footer, top header bar, main view switcher, and modals in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"  const handleAddTimeEntry = async (payload: {\\\\n    taskId: string;\\\\n    durationMinutes: number;\\\\n    notes: string;\\\\n  }) => {\\\\n    const res = await apiRequest<{ entry?: TimeEntry }>(\\\\n      \'/api/time-entries\',\\\\n      {\\\\n        method: \'POST\',\\\\n     \\n<truncated 29648 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"380\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"  const handleAddTimeEntry = async (payload: {\\\\n    taskId: string;\\\\n    durationMinutes: number;\\\\n    notes: string;\\\\n  }) => {\\\\n    await apiRequest(\\\\n      \'/api/time-entries\',\\\\n      {\\\\n        method: \'POST\',\\\\n        body: JSON.stringify(payload),\\\\n\\n<truncated 24066 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Wiring AI Copilot, Command Palette, and Google Auth in MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Wire AI Copilot and Command Palette\\\"\",\"waitForPreviousTools\":\"true\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}"
