  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering Critical Bug**\n\nI\'ve just spotted a major layout bug! While reviewing the screenshots, I noticed the \"Grounded Task Context\" select element is overflowing horizontally in `AiCopilotView.tsx`. This needs immediate attention!\n\n\n**Analyzing Layout Issues**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the root cause of that nasty horizontal scroll! The long task title in the select element is overflowing on both desktop and mobile. Specifically, the `<option>` is too wide, and the containing `<div>` and `<select>` elements lack the necessary constraints. Additionally, I found that the `scrollIntoView` call is scrolling the entire page, rather than just the chat container, explaining that jumpiness we saw.\n\n\n"
