  planner_response {
    response: "I have upgraded **MIHIR Workspace** for daily engineering use on the **Ray** project, integrating **Firebase Authentication & Cloud Firestore sync**, a **multi-model Gemini Engineering Copilot**, and daily productivity workflows.\n\n### What Was Added & Upgraded\n\n1. **Firebase Authentication & Cloud Firestore Sync**\n   - **Google Sign-In & Real-Time Cloud Sync**: Sign in from the sidebar or Settings using Google Authentication (`signInWithPopup`) to automatically synchronize your tasks, engineering work notes, time entries, and AI Copilot threads to your provisioned Cloud Firestore database (`ai-studio-mihirworkspace-9782de47-d45e-447b-963b-7b19491e18a1`) while keeping local SQLite + disk storage active for instant offline access.\n   - **Hardened Zero-Trust Security Rules**: Created and deployed `firestore.rules` (validated with `@firebase/eslint-plugin-security-rules` and `firestore.rules.test.ts`) enforcing verified email authentication, strict schema/key allowlisting, bounded array guards, immutable ownership/creation timestamps, action-based updates, and parent-document ownership checks on `/chatThreads/{threadId}/messages/{messageId}`.\n   - *Security Note*: While these rules follow zero-trust validation patterns, please review and further harden `firestore.rules` in your Firebase console before sharing the application broadly.\n\n2. **Multi-Turn Gemini Engineering Copilot (`AI Copilot`)**\n   - **Model Tier Selection**: Switch between `gemini-4-argon` (complex multi-repo architecture & root-cause analysis), `gemini-3.8-flash` (general engineering investigation & test planning), and `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` (fast terminal Git command generation & daily standup formatting) using `@google/genai`\'s multi-turn `ai.chats.create` API.\n   - **Role-Based System Instructions**: Choose from four specialized engineering personas:\n     - *Ray Root-Cause Investigator*\n     - *Git & Release Workflow Coach (14-Stage Stepper)*\n     - *QA & Verification Strategist*\n     - *Fast Standup & Sprint Summarizer*\n   - **Live Task Context Grounding**: Attach any active Ray task (`MIHIR-001` through `MIHIR-004`) or the full workspace overview so the assistant has direct context on your repositories (`raydashboard`, `rayhubapp`, `rayjobapp`), working/base branches, changed files, and test blockers. Save any assistant response directly to your **Work Log** with one click.\n\n3. **Daily Engineering Productivity Upgrades**\n   - **Today\'s Daily Engineering Focus Bar**: Pin, check off, and manage your top daily action items linked to specific `MIHIR-*` task codes directly at the top of the Dashboard.\n   - **`Cmd+K` / `Ctrl+K` Developer Command Palette**: Press `Cmd+K` (or `Ctrl+K`) from anywhere to search tasks by ID, branch (`RAY-MIHIR-*`), or file path, jump directly to a task\'s *Investigation*, *Changed Files*, or *Git Stepper* tab, toggle light/dark mode, or trigger cloud sync.\n   - **One-Click Daily Standup Generator**: Copy a formatted Markdown summary of your active Ray tasks, repository branches, file/test counts, and blockers to your clipboard from the Dashboard or Command Palette."
