ication Strategist*\n     - *Fast Standup & Sprint Summarizer*\n   - **Live Task Context Grounding**: Attach any active Ray task (`MIHIR-001` through `MIHIR-004`) or the full workspace overview so the assistant has direct context on your repositories (`raydashboard`, `rayhubapp`, `rayjobapp`), working/base branches, changed files, and test blockers. Save any assistant response directly to your **Work Log** with one click.\n\n3. **Daily Engineering Productivity Upgrades**\n   - **Today\'s Daily Engineering Focus Bar**: Pin, check off, and manage your top daily action items linked to specific `MIHIR-*` task codes directly at the top of the Dashboard.\n   - **`Cmd+K` / `Ctrl+K` Developer Command Palette**: Press `Cmd+K` (or `Ctrl+K`) from anywhere to search tasks by ID, branch (`RAY-MIHIR-*`), or file path, jump directly to a task\'s *Investigation*, *Changed Files*, or *Git Stepper* tab, toggle light/dark mode, or trigger cloud sync.\n   - **One-Click Daily Standup Generator**: Copy a formatted Markdown summary of your active Ray tasks, repository branches, file/test counts, and blockers to your clipboard from the Dashboard or Command Palette."
