  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Task API Functionality**\n\nI\'m currently updating `/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts` to improve task handling. Specifically, `POST /api/tasks` will now save `subtasks` as an array if provided, or an empty array if not. The `POST /api/tasks/:id/duplicate` endpoint will now clone subtasks with a `completed: false` state. This should streamline creating new tasks with fresh checklist items. I\'m leveraging `multi_replace_file_content` for this.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
