assName=\"font-mono\">{task.changedFiles.length} files</span>\n                          <span>\302\267</span>\n                          <span className=\"font-mono\">{task.tests.length} tests</span>\n                        </div>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 align-top whitespace-nowrap\">\n                        <select\n                          aria-label={`Change status for ${task.taskCode}`}\n                          value={task.status}\n                          onChange={(e) => onUpdateTaskStatus(task.id, e.target.value as TaskStatus)}\n                          className=\"px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-md border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\"\n                        >\n                          {ALL_STATUSES.map((st) => (\n                            <option key={st} value={st}>\n                              {st}\n                            </option>\n                          ))}\n                        </select>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 align-top whitespace-nowrap font-medium\">\n                        <span\n                          className={\n                            task.priority === \'Urgent\'\n                              ? \'text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-semibold\'\n                              : task.priority === \'High\'\n                              ? \'text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\'\n                              : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\'\n                          }\n                        >\n                          {task.priority}\n                        </span>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 align-top\">\n                        <div className=\"space-y-1\">\n                          {task.repositories.map((r) => (\n                            <div key={r.id} className=\"font-mono text-[11px] flex items-center gap-1\">\n                              <GitBranch className=\"w-3 h-3 text-indigo-500 shrink-0\" />\n                              <span className=\"font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\">\n                                {r.repositoryName}\n                              </span>\n                              <span className=\"text-slate-400\">/</span>\n                              <span className=\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 truncate max-w-[160px]\">\n                                {r.workingBranch}\n                              </span>\n                            </div>\n                          ))}\n                        </div>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 align-top font-mono tabular-nums\">\n                        <div className=\"space-y-1.5\">\n                          {repoSummaries.map((s) => (\n                            <div key={s.repositoryName} className=\"space-y-0.5\">\n                              <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">\n                                <span>\n                                  {s.completedCount}/{s.applicableCount} stages\n                                </span>\n                                <span>{s.percent}%</span>\n                              </div>\n                              <div className=\"w-28 h-1.5 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                                <div\n                                  className=\"h-full bg-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-400\"\n                                  style={{ width: `${s.percent}%` }}\n                                />\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          ))}\n                        </div>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 align-top font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-500 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums\">\n                        <div>Due: {formatUnambiguousDate(task.dueDate, timezone, false)}</div>\n                        <div className=\"mt-0.5\">\n                          Upd: {formatUnambiguousDate(task.updatedAt, timezone, false)}\n                        </div>\n                      </td>\n                      <td className=\"py-3.5 px-4 align-top text-right whitespace-nowrap\">\n                        <div className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\">\n                          <button\n                            type=\"button\"\n                            onClick={() => onDuplicateTask(task.id)}\n                            title=\"Duplicate task as starting point\"\n                            aria-label={`Duplicate ${task.taskCode}`}\n                            className=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800\"\n                          >\n                            <Copy className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                          </button>\n                          {task.isArchived ? (\n                            <button\n                              type=\"button\"\n                              onClick={() => onToggleArchiveTask(task.id, false)}\n                              title=\"Recover archived task\"\n                              aria-label={`Recover ${task.taskCode}`}\n                              className=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-50 dark:hover:bg-amber-950/50\"\n                            >\n                              <ArchiveRestore className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                            </button>\n                          ) : (\n                            <button\n                              type=\"button\"\n                              onClick={() => onToggleArchiveTask(task.id, true)}\n                              title=\"Archive task\"\n                              aria-label={`Archive ${task.taskCode}`}\n                              className=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800\"\n                            >\n                              <Archive className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                            </button>\n                          )}\n                          {confirmDeleteId === task.id ? (\n                            <button\n                              type=\"button\"\n                              onClick={() => {\n                                onDeleteTask(task.id);\n                                setConfirmDeleteId(null);\n                              }}\n                              className=\"px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-white bg-red-600 rounded hover:bg-red-500\"\n                            >\n                              Confirm Delete\n                            </button>\n                          ) : (\n                            <button\n                              type=\"button\"\n                              onClick={() => setConfirmDeleteId(task.id)}\n                              title=\"Delete task\"\n                              aria-label={`Delete ${task.taskCode}`}\n                              className=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-400 hover:text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50 dark:hover:bg-red-950/40\"\n                            >\n                              <Trash2 className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                            </button>\n                          )}\n                        </div>\n                      </td>\n                    </tr>\n                  );\n                })}\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      ) : (\n        /* Kanban Board View */\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\">\n          {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\n            const colTasks = filteredTasks.filter((t) => t.status === colStatus);\n            return (\n              <div\n                key={colStatus}\n                className=\"flex flex-col rounded-xl bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-3.5 min-h-[260px]\"\n              >\n                <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                  <h3 className=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\">\n                    {colStatus}\n                  </h3>\n                  <span className=\"text-xs font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-500\">\n                    {colTasks.length}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div className=\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\">\n                  {colTasks.length === 0 ? (\n                    <div className=\"h-24 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 border border-dashed border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg\">\n                      No tasks in {colStatus}\n                    </div>\n                  ) : (\n                    colTasks.map((task) => {\n                      const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\n                      const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\n                      return (\n                        <div\n                          key={task.id}\n                          className=\"p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 space-y-2\"\n                        >\n                          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\">\n                            <span className=\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 whitespace-nowrap\">\n                              {task.taskCode}\n      