  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Current User Request**: Create a new board view in the `TaskListView` component (`/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx`) that displays tasks in columns based on their status (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) to provide a drag-and-drop workflow experience.\n   - **Success Criteria**:\n     - `TaskListView` provides a 4-column workflow Board View (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) alongside Table View (and optional toggle to inspect all 7 granular statuses).\n     - Tasks map cleanly between granular `TaskStatus` values (`\'Backlog\' | \'Assigned\' | \'In Progress\' | \'Blocked\' | \'Ready for Testing\' | \'In Review\' | \'Done\'`) and the 4 board columns:\n       - `Todo` \342\206\224 `\'Backlog\' | \'Assigned\'` (dropping into `Todo` sets status to `\'Assigned\'`)\n       - `In Progress` \342\206\224 `\'In Progress\' | \'Blocked\'` (dropping into `In Progress` sets status to `\'In Progress\'`)\n       - `Review` \342\206\224 `\'Ready for Testing\' | \'In Review\'` (dropping into `Review` sets status to `\'In Review\'`)\n       - `Done` \342\206\224 `\'Done\'` (dropping into `Done` sets status to `\'Done\'`)\n     - Full HTML5 drag-and-drop (`draggable`, `onDragStart`, `onDragOver`, `onDragEnter`, `onDragLeave`, `onDrop`, `onDragEnd`) with visual drop-zone highlighting, drag handle (`GripVertical`), card drag styling, and immediate persistence via `onUpdateTaskStatus(taskId, nextStatus)`.\n     - Pure logic unit-tested via `node:test` (`npx tsx --test MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts MIHIR/server/db.test.ts`) and verified in headless browser (`playwright-cli`).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed Previously**:\n     - Full-stack **MIHIR Workspace** app (`server.ts`, `/MIHIR/server/db.ts`, `/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts`, `/MIHIR/server/seedAssets.ts`, `/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`).\n     - Sub-task / Checklist visual progress indicators (`TaskChecklistItem`, `TaskChecklistProgressSummary`, `summarizeTaskChecklistProgress`) added across `/MIHIR/src/types/workspace.ts`, `/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts`, `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx`, `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskDetailView.tsx`, and `/MIHIR/src/components/NewTaskModal.tsx`.\n     - Fixed all TypeScript lint issues in `/MIHIR/server/geminiChat.ts`, `/MIHIR/src/components/CommandPaletteModal.tsx`, and `/MIHIR/src/lib/firebaseClient.ts`; both `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` (`tsc --noEmit`) pass with 0 errors.\n   - **In Progress**:\n     - Implementing the 4-column (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) drag-and-drop Board View in `/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts` and `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - `/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts` is 643 lines long. We viewed up to line 427 and need to view lines 600\342\200\223643 before appending the new pure board-column mapping helpers (`BoardWorkflowColumnId`, `BOARD_WORKFLOW_COLUMNS`, `mapStatusToBoardColumn`, `resolveStatusFromBoardColumnDrop`, `groupTasksByBoardColumn`).\n   - `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx` currently has `viewMode: \'table\' | \'kanban\'` (lines 70\342\200\223880). Updating the Board View in `TaskListView.tsx` to render the 4-column drag-and-drop workflow (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) by default when in Board View (with an optional sub-toggle for `\"4-Column Workflow\"` vs `\"7-Stage Detailed\"`) will cleanly satisfy the user\'s request while preserving granular status visibility on each card.\n\n4. **Active Context**\n   - Dev server is running on `http://localhost:3000`.\n   - SQLite database at `/MIHIR/data/mihir_workspace.sqlite` is seeded with 4 realistic Ray engineering tasks (`MIHIR-001` in `Ready for Testing`, `MIHIR-002` in `In Progress`, `MIHIR-003` in `In Review`, `MIHIR-004` in `Blocked`), each with structured `subtasks` and multi-repo Git stages.\n\n5. **Next Steps**\n   1. View the end of `/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.ts` (lines 600\342\200\223643) and add `BoardWorkflowColumnId`, `BOARD_WORKFLOW_COLUMNS`, `mapStatusToBoardColumn`, `resolveStatusFromBoardColumnDrop`, and `groupTasksByBoardColumn`.\n   2. Add unit tests for the board column mapping and drag-and-drop status resolution in `/MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts`.\n   3. View lines 240\342\200\223300 and lines 630\342\200\223880 of `/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx` and update `TaskListView.tsx` to implement the 4-column (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) drag-and-drop Board View with:\n      - Drag state (`draggedTaskId`, `dragOverColumnId`) and HTML5 drag-and-drop handlers (`handleDragStart`, `handleDragOver`, `handleDragLeave`, `handleDrop`, `handleDragEnd`).\n      - Visual drop target column indicators, task count & checklist progress summaries per column, draggable task cards with `GripVertical` handle, granular status badge, sub-task checklist progress bar, repository/branch summary, and quick status dropdown.\n   4. Run unit tests (`npx tsx --test MIHIR/src/lib/workspaceLogic.test.ts MIHIR/server/db.test.ts`), `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and verify the drag-and-drop board view in `playwright-cli` at desktop (`1440x900`) and mobile (`390x844`).\n\n6. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Maintain high-craft dark/light UI discipline (no decorative pill bloat, `tabular-nums` on all counters, crisp 1px borders).\n   - Keep task status decoupled from Git workflow stages; dragging a task between `Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, and `Done` updates `task.status` in SQLite without falsely marking Git stages complete.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 278
    included_step_index_end: 362
