  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Component Labels**\n\nI\'m focused on improving the `TaskListView.tsx` component. Specifically, I\'m working to make the board header bar more concise by shortening the button label. The current label is quite verbose, and I believe it can be significantly improved for better visual clarity. This should make the interface more user-friendly.\n\n\n**Optimizing Mobile Display**\n\nI\'ve been analyzing how \"7-Stage Granular\" renders on mobile (390px) and am glad it displays without clipping. I\'ve also focused on the card layout, and I\'m updating how that card looks like, which is in the top row and footer. In the footer, I\'m improving the existing 2-row workflow controls, planning out a single-row design. I\'m playing with a 4-column move bar (`Todo` \302\267 `Active` / `In Progress` \302\267 `Review` \302\267 `Done`) or a single row with granular status and Prev/Next controls.\n\n\n"
