  planner_response {
    response: "A 4-column drag-and-drop **Board View** (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) has been added to `TaskListView`.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n- **4-Column Workflow Board (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`)**:\n  - Maps the 7 granular task statuses into 4 workflow columns (`Todo` for `Backlog` & `Assigned`; `In Progress` for `In Progress` & `Blocked`; `Review` for `Ready for Testing` & `In Review`; `Done` for `Done`), while retaining a toggle to switch to the **7-Stage Granular** board at any time.\n  - Displays column task counts and aggregated sub-task/checklist completion totals (`Checks: X/Y`) in each column header.\n- **Drag-and-Drop Workflow Experience**:\n  - Task cards are draggable (`draggable`, drag handle indicator, active drag styling) across columns with drop-zone highlighting and drop target banners.\n  - Dropping a card into a column resolves its new status (`Assigned`, `In Progress`, `In Review`, or `Done`) and persists the update immediately via SQLite and optional Firebase sync, accompanied by a confirmation status notice and quick-move buttons for keyboard accessibility.\n- **Card Details & Progress Indicators**:\n  - Each card displays its granular status badge, priority, interactive sub-task/checklist progress bar (`X/Y (Z%)` with expandable checklist toggle), repository/working branch, and Git progress summary."
    modified_response: "A 4-column drag-and-drop **Board View** (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`) has been added to `TaskListView`.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n- **4-Column Workflow Board (`Todo`, `In Progress`, `Review`, `Done`)**:\n  - Maps the 7 granular task statuses into 4 workflow columns (`Todo` for `Backlog` & `Assigned`; `In Progress` for `In Progress` & `Blocked`; `Review` for `Ready for Testing` & `In Review`; `Done` for `Done`), while retaining a toggle to switch to the **7-Stage Granular** board at any time.\n  - Displays column task counts and aggregated sub-task/checklist completion totals (`Checks: X/Y`) in each column header.\n- **Drag-and-Drop Workflow Experience**:\n  - Task cards are draggable (`draggable`, drag handle indicator, active drag styling) across columns with drop-zone highlighting and drop target banners.\n  - Dropping a card into a column resolves its new status (`Assigned`, `In Progress`, `In Review`, or `Done`) and persists the update immediately via SQLite and optional Firebase sync, accompanied by a confirmation status notice and quick-move buttons for keyboard accessibility.\n- **Card Details & Progress Indicators**:\n  - Each card displays its granular status badge, priority, interactive sub-task/checklist progress bar (`X/Y (Z%)` with expandable checklist toggle), repository/working branch, and Git progress summary."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
