  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding Reorder Endpoint**\n\nI\'m currently working on incorporating the \"reorder\" functionality. I\'m adding a new POST endpoint `/api/tasks/reorder` in `/MIHIR/server/apiRouter.ts`. This endpoint will sit right before the existing `POST /api/tasks/:id/duplicate`. I\'m also preparing to add the `handleReorderTasks` method in `/MIHIR/src/MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`, where I\'ll connect it by passing `onReorderTasks`.\n\n\n**Implementing Drag-and-Drop**\n\nI\'ve made substantial progress. I\'ve integrated `onReorderTasks` and related state variables into `<TaskListView />`. I\'ve added drag-over and drop handlers at the card level. I\'ve also implemented step-by-step reordering for both the 4-Column and 7-Stage views. Finally, I\'ve added the required visual indicators and reorder buttons. Next, I\'ll be adding unit tests for the backend and the workspaceLogic to handle these changes.\n\n\n"
