  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Board View JSX**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `TaskListView.tsx` file, specifically lines 982-1445, to modify the 4-Column Workflow board. I\'m adding `onDragOver` and `onDrop` handlers to each card within the board. Specifically, I\'m setting `onDragOver={(e) => handleCardDragOver(e, col.id, task.id, columnTaskIds)}` and `onDrop={(e) => handleWorkflowColumnDrop` to each card. My goal is to enable drag-and-drop functionality within this board structure.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Cues**\n\nI\'m now implementing visual cues for task reordering within the drag-and-drop workflow. I\'m focusing on displaying insertion lines (\"Insert before\" or \"Insert after\") based on drag-over position relative to existing cards. I\'m also adding a column order index and compact Move Up/Down buttons to the card header to enable alternative reordering methods, particularly when multiple tasks exist in a column.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_340430"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add card-level drag-and-drop reordering, drop insertion indicators, and Move Up/Down buttons in TaskListView.tsx\", \"EndLine\":1444, \"Instruction\":\"Update the Board View JSX in TaskListView.tsx to support same-column and cross-column drag-and-drop reordering and order persistence\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"      ) : (\\n        /* Drag-and-Drop Board View (Todo, In Progress, Review, Done) */\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-3.5\\\" data-testid=\\\"task-board-view\\\">\\n          {/* Board Header Bar: Drag Hint, Move Feedback, and 4-Column vs 7-Stage Switcher */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <GripVertical className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>\\n                Drag cards within a column to reorder priority or across columns to update workflow status.\\n              </span>\\n              {lastBoardMoveNotice && (\\n                <span\\n                  data-testid=\\\"board-move-notice\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/70 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 font-mono text-[11px]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {lastBoardMoveNotice}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-0.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 self-start sm:self-auto shrink-0\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                data-testid=\\\"board-layout-workflow4\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setBoardLayoutMode(\'workflow4\')}\\n                className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  boardLayoutMode === \'workflow4\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 shadow-2xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                4-Column Workflow\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                data-testid=\\\"board-layout-detailed7\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setBoardLayoutMode(\'detailed7\')}\\n                className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  boardLayoutMode === \'detailed7\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 shadow-2xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                7-Stage Granular\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {boardLayoutMode === \'workflow4\' ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\\\">\\n              {BOARD_WORKFLOW_COLUMNS.map((col) => {\\n                const colTasks = groupedBoardTasks[col.id] || [];\\n                const columnTaskIds = colTasks.map((t) => t.id);\\n                const isDropActive = dragOverColumnId === col.id;\\n                const completedSubtasksInCol = colTasks.reduce(\\n                  (acc, t) => acc + summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(t).completedCount,\\n                  0\\n                );\\n                const totalSubtasksInCol = colTasks.reduce(\\n                  (acc, t) => acc + summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(t).totalCount,\\n                  0\\n                );\\n\\n                return (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={col.id}\\n                    data-testid={`board-column-${col.id}`}\\n                    onDragOver={(e) => handleColumnDragOver(e, col.id)}\\n                    onDragLeave={(e) => handleColumnDragLeave(e, col.id)}\\n                    onDrop={(e) => handleWorkflowColumnDrop(e, col.id, null)}\\n                    className={`flex flex-col rounded-xl p-3.5 min-h-[420px] transition-all border ${\\n                      isDropActive\\n                        ? \'bg-indigo-50/70 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/20\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {/* Column Header */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                          <span\\n                            className={`w-2 h-2 rounded-full ${\\n                              col.id === \'Done\'\\n                                ? \'bg-emerald-500\'\\n                                : col.id === \'Review\'\\n                                ? \'bg-amber-500\'\\n                                : col.id === \'In Progress\'\\n                                ? \'bg-indigo-500\'\\n                                : \'bg-slate-400\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          />\\n                          <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                            {col.label}\\n                          </h3>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <span\\n                          data-testid={`board-column-count-${col.id}`}\\n                          className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tabular-nums rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          {colTasks.length}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                        <span>{col.subtitle}</span>\\n                        {totalSubtasksInCol > 0 && (\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[10px]\\\">\\n                            Checks: {completedSubtasksInCol}/{totalSubtasksInCol}\\n                          </span>\\n                        )}\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {/* Active Drop Indicator when hovering column space */}\\n                    {isDropActive && !dragOverTaskId && (\\n                      <div\\n                        data-testid={`board-drop-indicator-${col.id}`}\\n                        className=\\\"mb-2.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-indigo-500 bg-indigo-500/10 text-[11px] font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 text-center\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Drop card to place in {col.label} ({col.defaultDropStatus})\\n                      </div>\\n                    )}\\n\\n                    {/* Column Cards */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\\\">\\n                      {colTasks.length === 0 ? (\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-32 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 border border-dashed border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                          <span>No tasks in {col.label}</span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-[10px] mt-0.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600\\\">\\n                            Drag a task card here to set status to {col.defaultDropStatus}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                      ) : (\\n                        colTasks.map((task, cardIndex) => {\\n                          const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\\n                          const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\\n                          const checklist = summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(task);\\n                          const isChecklistExpanded = Boolean(expandedChecklistIds[task.id]);\\n                          const isDragging = draggedTaskId === task.id;\\n                          const isDropTargetBefore =\\n                            dragOverTaskId === task.id && dragOverPosition === \'before\';\\n                          const isDropTargetAfter =\\n                            dragOverTaskId === task.id && dragOverPosition === \'after\';\\n                          const currentColId = mapStatusToBoardColumn(task.status);\\n\\n                          return (\\n                            <div key={task.id} className=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                              {isDropTargetBefore && (\\n                                <div\\n                                  data-testid={`drop-indicator-before-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                  className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-500/15 border border-indigo-500 text-[10px] font-mono font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 text-center\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  Drop before {task.taskCode}\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n\\n                              <div\\n                                draggable\\n                                data-testid={`board-card-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                data-board-order={cardIndex + 1}\\n                                onDragStart={(e) => handleTaskDragStart(e, task.id)}\\n                                onDragEnd={handleTaskDragEnd}\\n                                onDragOver={(e) =>\\n                                  handleCardDragOver(e, col.id, task.id, columnTaskIds)\\n                                }\\n                                onDrop={(e) => handleWorkflowColumnDrop(e, col.id, task.id)}\\n                                className={`p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border transition-all space-y-2.5 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing ${\\n                                  isDragging\\n                                    ? \'opacity-50 scale-[0.98] border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/30\'\\n                                    : isDropTargetBefore || isDropTargetAfter\\n                                    ? \'border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/25\'\\n                                    : \'border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 dark:hover:border-indigo-500/70 shadow-2xs\'\\n                                }`}\\n                              >\\n                                {/* Card Top Metadata Row */}\\n                                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                                    <GripVertical\\n                                      className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 shrink-0\\\"\\n                                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                                    />\\n                                    <span\\n                                      data-testid={`board-rank-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                      className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 tabular-nums shrink-0\\\"\\n                                    >\\n                                      #{cardIndex + 1}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                    <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                                      {task.taskCode}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                    <span\\n                                      className={`px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] rounded font-sans font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                                        task.status === \'Blocked\'\\n                                          ? \'bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-700 dark:text-red-300 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60\'\\n                                          : task.status === \'Done\'\\n                                          ? \'bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-900/60\'\\n                                          : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\'\\n                                      }`}\\n                                    >\\n                                      {task.status}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n\\n                                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0\\\">\\n                                    {colTasks.length > 1 && (\\n                                      <div\\n                                        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950\\\"\\n                                        role=\\\"group\\\"\\n                                        aria-label={`Reorder ${task.taskCode} in ${col.label}`}\\n                                      >\\n                                        <button\\n                                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                          data-testid={`move-up-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                          aria-label={`Move ${task.taskCode} up in ${col.label}`}\\n                                          disabled={cardIndex === 0}\\n                                          onClick={() =>\\n                                            handleStepReorderInColumn(\\n                                              columnTaskIds,\\n                                              task.id,\\n                                              \'up\',\\n                                              col.label\\n                                            )\\n                                          }\\n                                          className=\\\"p-0.5 text-slate-500 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 disabled:opacity-30 disabled:pointer-events-none\\\"\\n                                          title=\\\"Move card up in column\\\"\\n                                        >\\n                                          <ArrowUp className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                                        </button>\\n                                        <button\\n                                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                          data-testid={`move-down-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                          aria-label={`Move ${task.taskCode} down in ${col.label}`}\\n                                          disabled={cardIndex === colTasks.length - 1}\\n                                          onClick={() =>\\n                                            handleStepReorderInColumn(\\n                                              columnTaskIds,\\n                                              task.id,\\n                                              \'down\',\\n                                              col.label\\n                                            )\\n                                          }\\n                                          className=\\\"p-0.5 text-slate-500 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 disabled:opacity-30 disabled:pointer-events-none\\\"\\n                                          title=\\\"Move card down in column\\\"\\n                                        >\\n                                          <ArrowDown className=\\\"w-3 h-3\\\" />\\n                                        </button>\\n                                      </div>\\n                                    )}\\n                                    <span\\n                                      className={`text-[10px] font-semibold whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                                        task.priority === \'Urgent\'\\n                                          ? \'text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\'\\n                                          : task.priority === \'High\'\\n                                          ? \'text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\'\\n                                          : \'text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                                      }`}\\n                                    >\\n                                      {task.priority}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                </div>\\n\\n                                {/* Task Title */}\\n                                <button\\n                                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                  onClick={() => onOpenTask(task.id)}\\n                                  className=\\\"text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 line-clamp-2 block w-full\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  {task.title}\\n                                </button>\\n\\n                                {/* Visual Sub-task / Checklist Progress Indicator */}\\n                                {checklist.hasChecklist && (\\n                                  <div\\n                                    data-testid={`kanban-checklist-progress-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                    className=\\\"p-2 rounded-md bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\"\\n                                  >\\n                                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                      <button\\n                                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                        onClick={() => toggleChecklistExpand(task.id)}\\n                                        className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400\\\"\\n                                      >\\n                                        <ListChecks\\n                                          className={`w-3 h-3 ${\\n                                            checklist.isComplete\\n                                              ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n                                              : \'text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\'\\n                                          }`}\\n                                        />\\n                                        <span>\\n                                          {checklist.source === \'subtasks\' ? \'Sub-tasks\' : \'Checklist\'}\\n                                        </span>\\n                                        {isChecklistExpanded ? (\\n                                          <ChevronUp className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                                        ) : (\\n                                          <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                                        )}\\n                                      </button>\\n                                      <span\\n                                        className={\\n                                          checklist.isComplete\\n                                            ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold\'\\n                                            : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold\'\\n                                        }\\n                                      >\\n                                        {checklist.completedCount}/{checklist.totalCount} ({checklist.percent}%)\\n                                      </span>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div\\n                                      role=\\\"progressbar\\\"\\n                                      aria-label={`${task.taskCode} kanban checklist progress`}\\n                                      aria-valuenow={checklist.percent}\\n                                      aria-valuemin={0}\\n                                      aria-valuemax={100}\\n                                      className=\\\"w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\"\\n                                    >\\n                                      <div\\n                                        className={`h-full transition-all duration-300 rounded-full ${\\n                                          checklist.isComplete\\n                                            ? \'bg-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-400\'\\n                                            : \'bg-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-400\'\\n                                        }`}\\n                                        style={{ width: `${checklist.percent}%` }}\\n                                      />\\n                                    </div>\\n\\n                                    {isChecklistExpanded && (\\n                                      <div className=\\\"pt-1 space-y-1 border-t border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                                        {checklist.items.map((item) => (\\n                                          <button\\n                                            key={item.id}\\n                                            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                            onClick={() =>\\n                                              onToggleSubtask && onToggleSubtask(task.id, item.id)\\n                                            }\\n                                            className=\\\"w-full flex items-start gap-1.5 text-left text-[10px] py-0.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600\\\"\\n                                          >\\n                                            <span\\n                                              className={`mt-0.5 w-3 h-3 rounded flex items-center justify-center border shrink-0 ${\\n                                                item.completed\\n                                                  ? \'bg-emerald-600 border-emerald-600 text-white\'\\n                                                  : \'border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\'\\n                                              }`}\\n                                            >\\n                                              {item.completed && <Check className=\\\"w-2 h-2\\\" />}\\n                                            </span>\\n                                            <span\\n                                              className={\\n                                                item.completed\\n                                                  ? \'line-through text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500\'\\n                                                  : \'\'\\n                                              }\\n                                            >\\n                                              {item.title}\\n                                            </span>\\n                                          </button>\\n                                        ))}\\n                                      </div>\\n                                    )}\\n                                  </div>\\n                                )}\\n\\n                                {/* Repository & Git Summary */}\\n                                {firstRepo && prog && (\\n                                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                                    <div className=\\\"truncate text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                      {firstRepo.repositoryName} \302\267{\' \'}\\n                                      <span className=\\\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\">\\n                                        {firstRepo.workingBranch}\\n                                      </span>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                    <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                      <span>\\n                                        Git: {prog.completedCount}/{prog.applicableCount} ({prog.percent}%)\\n                                      </span>\\n                                      <span>Due: {formatUnambiguousDate(task.dueDate, timezone, false)}</span>\\n                                    </div>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                )}\\n\\n                                {/* Quick Workflow Stage & Granular Status Controls */}\\n                                <div className=\\\"pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1\\\">\\n                                    {BOARD_WORKFLOW_COLUMNS.map((targetCol) => {\\n                                      const isCurrentCol = currentColId === targetCol.id;\\n                                      return (\\n                                        <button\\n                                          key={targetCol.id}\\n                                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                          data-testid={`quick-move-${task.taskCode}-${targetCol.id}`}\\n                                          disabled={isCurrentCol}\\n                                          onClick={() =>\\n                                            handleMoveTaskToWorkflowColumn(task.id, targetCol.id)\\n                                          }\\n                                          className={`py-1 px-0.5 text-[9.5px] tracking-tight font-medium rounded border transition-colors text-center whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                                            isCurrentCol\\n                                              ? \'bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/60 border-indigo-300 dark:border-indigo-800 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 cursor-default\'\\n                                              : \'bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-300\'\\n                                          }`}\\n                                          title={`Move ${task.taskCode} to ${targetCol.label}`}\\n                                        >\\n                                          {targetCol.label}\\n                                        </button>\\n                                      );\\n                                    })}\\n                                  </div>\\n\\n                                  <select\\n                                    aria-label={`Move ${task.taskCode} to status`}\\n                                    value={task.status}\\n                                    onChange={(e) =>\\n                                      onUpdateTaskStatus(task.id, e.target.value as TaskStatus)\\n                                    }\\n                                    className=\\\"w-full px-2 py-1 text-[11px] rounded border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\"\\n                                  >\\n                                    {ALL_STATUSES.map((st) => (\\n                                      <option key={st} value={st}>\\n                                        Status: {st}\\n                                      </option>\\n                                    ))}\\n                                  </select>\\n                                </div>\\n                              </div>\\n\\n                              {isDropTargetAfter && (\\n                                <div\\n                                  data-testid={`drop-indicator-after-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                  className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-500/15 border border-indigo-500 text-[10px] font-mono font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 text-center\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  Drop after {task.taskCode}\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n                            </div>\\n                          );\\n                        })\\n                      )}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            /* 7-Stage Granular Drag-and-Drop View */\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\\\">\\n              {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\\n                const colTasks = sortTasksByBoardOrder(\\n                  filteredTasks.filter((t) => t.status === colStatus)\\n                );\\n                const columnTaskIds = colTasks.map((t) => t.id);\\n                const isDropActive = dragOverColumnId === colStatus;\\n                return (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={colStatus}\\n                    data-testid={`detailed-column-${colStatus}`}\\n                    onDragOver={(e) => handleColumnDragOver(e, colStatus)}\\n                    onDragLeave={(e) => handleColumnDragLeave(e, colStatus)}\\n                    onDrop={(e) => handleDetailedStatusDrop(e, colStatus, null)}\\n                    className={`flex flex-col rounded-xl p-3.5 min-h-[260px] transition-all border ${\\n                      isDropActive\\n                        ? \'bg-indigo-50/70 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/20\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                      <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                        {colStatus}\\n                      </h3>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-500\\\">\\n                        {colTasks.length}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\\\">\\n                      {colTasks.length === 0 ? (\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-24 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 border border-dashed border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                          No tasks in {colStatus}\\n                        </div>\\n                      ) : (\\n                        colTasks.map((task, cardIndex) => {\\n                          const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\\n                          const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\\n                          const checklist = summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(task);\\n                          const isChecklistExpanded = Boolean(expandedChecklistIds[task.id]);\\n\\n                          return (\\n                            <div\\n                              key={task.id}\\n                              draggable\\n                              data-testid={`detailed-card-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                              onDragStart={(e) => handleTaskDragStart(e, task.id)}\\n                              onDragEnd={handleTaskDragEnd}\\n                              onDragOver={(e) =>\\n                                handleCardDragOver(e, colStatus, task.id, columnTaskIds)\\n                              }\\n                              onDrop={(e) => handleDetailedStatusDrop(e, colStatus, task.id)}\\n                              className=\\\"p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 space-y-2 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\\\"\\n                            >\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n                                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    #{cardIndex + 1}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                  <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                                    {task.taskCode}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <span className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap\\\">{task.priority}</span>\\n                              </div>\\n                              <button\\n                                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                onClick={() => onOpenTask(task.id)}\\n                                className=\\\"text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 line-clamp-2 block\\\"\\n                              >\\n                                {task.title}\\n                              </button>\\n\\n                              {checklist.hasChecklist && (\\n                                <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded-md bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    <button\\n                                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                      onClick={() => toggleChecklistExpand(task.id)}\\n                                      className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400\\\"\\n                                    >\\n                                      <ListChecks className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\" />\\n                                      <span>\\n                                        {checklist.source === \'subtasks\' ? \'Sub-tasks\' : \'Checklist\'}\\n                                      </span>\\n                                    </button>\\n                                    <span>\\n                                      {checklist.completedCount}/{checklist.totalCount} ({checklist.percent}%)\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n\\n                              {firstRepo && prog && (\\n                                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"truncate text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                    {firstRepo.repositoryName} \302\267{\' \'}\\n                                    <span className=\\\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\">\\n                                      {firstRepo.workingBranch}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n                            </div>\\n                          );\\n                        })\\n                      )}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\", \"StartLine\":981, \"TargetContent\":\"      ) : (\\n        /* Drag-and-Drop Board View (Todo, In Progress, Review, Done) */\\n        <div className=\\\"space-y-3.5\\\" data-testid=\\\"task-board-view\\\">\\n          {/* Board Header Bar: Drag Hint, Move Feedback, and 4-Column vs 7-Stage Switcher */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <GripVertical className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>\\n                Drag and drop task cards across columns to update workflow status.\\n              </span>\\n              {lastBoardMoveNotice && (\\n                <span\\n                  data-testid=\\\"board-move-notice\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/70 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 font-mono text-[11px]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {lastBoardMoveNotice}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1 p-0.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 self-start sm:self-auto shrink-0\\\">\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                data-testid=\\\"board-layout-workflow4\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setBoardLayoutMode(\'workflow4\')}\\n                className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  boardLayoutMode === \'workflow4\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 shadow-2xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                4-Column Workflow\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                data-testid=\\\"board-layout-detailed7\\\"\\n                onClick={() => setBoardLayoutMode(\'detailed7\')}\\n                className={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium rounded-md transition-colors whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                  boardLayoutMode === \'detailed7\'\\n                    ? \'bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 shadow-2xs\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-900 dark:hover:text-slate-200\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                7-Stage Granular\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {boardLayoutMode === \'workflow4\' ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\\\">\\n              {BOARD_WORKFLOW_COLUMNS.map((col) => {\\n                const colTasks = groupedBoardTasks[col.id] || [];\\n                const isDropActive = dragOverColumnId === col.id;\\n                const completedSubtasksInCol = colTasks.reduce(\\n                  (acc, t) => acc + summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(t).completedCount,\\n                  0\\n                );\\n                const totalSubtasksInCol = colTasks.reduce(\\n                  (acc, t) => acc + summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(t).totalCount,\\n                  0\\n                );\\n\\n                return (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={col.id}\\n                    data-testid={`board-column-${col.id}`}\\n                    onDragOver={(e) => handleColumnDragOver(e, col.id)}\\n                    onDragLeave={(e) => handleColumnDragLeave(e, col.id)}\\n                    onDrop={(e) => handleWorkflowColumnDrop(e, col.id)}\\n                    className={`flex flex-col rounded-xl p-3.5 min-h-[420px] transition-all border ${\\n                      isDropActive\\n                        ? \'bg-indigo-50/70 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/20\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {/* Column Header */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                          <span\\n                            className={`w-2 h-2 rounded-full ${\\n                              col.id === \'Done\'\\n                                ? \'bg-emerald-500\'\\n                                : col.id === \'Review\'\\n                                ? \'bg-amber-500\'\\n                                : col.id === \'In Progress\'\\n                                ? \'bg-indigo-500\'\\n                                : \'bg-slate-400\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          />\\n                          <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                            {col.label}\\n                          </h3>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <span\\n                          data-testid={`board-column-count-${col.id}`}\\n                          className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tabular-nums rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          {colTasks.length}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n                        <span>{col.subtitle}</span>\\n                        {totalSubtasksInCol > 0 && (\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[10px]\\\">\\n                            Checks: {completedSubtasksInCol}/{totalSubtasksInCol}\\n                          </span>\\n                        )}\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {/* Active Drop Indicator */}\\n                    {isDropActive && (\\n                      <div\\n                        data-testid={`board-drop-indicator-${col.id}`}\\n                        className=\\\"mb-2.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-indigo-500 bg-indigo-500/10 text-[11px] font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 text-center\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        Drop card to move to {col.label} ({col.defaultDropStatus})\\n                      </div>\\n                    )}\\n\\n                    {/* Column Cards */}\\n                    <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\\\">\\n                      {colTasks.length === 0 ? (\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-32 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 border border-dashed border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                          <span>No tasks in {col.label}</span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-[10px] mt-0.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600\\\">\\n                            Drag a task card here to set status to {col.defaultDropStatus}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                      ) : (\\n                        colTasks.map((task) => {\\n                          const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\\n                          const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\\n                          const checklist = summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(task);\\n                          const isChecklistExpanded = Boolean(expandedChecklistIds[task.id]);\\n                          const isDragging = draggedTaskId === task.id;\\n                          const currentColId = mapStatusToBoardColumn(task.status);\\n\\n                          return (\\n                            <div\\n                              key={task.id}\\n                              draggable\\n                              data-testid={`board-card-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                              onDragStart={(e) => handleTaskDragStart(e, task.id)}\\n                              onDragEnd={handleTaskDragEnd}\\n                              className={`p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border transition-all space-y-2.5 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing ${\\n                                isDragging\\n                                  ? \'opacity-50 scale-[0.98] border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/30\'\\n                                  : \'border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 dark:hover:border-indigo-500/70 shadow-2xs\'\\n                              }`}\\n                            >\\n                              {/* Card Top Metadata Row */}\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono\\\">\\n                                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 min-w-0\\\">\\n                                  <GripVertical\\n                                    className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 shrink-0\\\"\\n                                    aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                                  />\\n                                  <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                                    {task.taskCode}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                  <span\\n                                    className={`px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] rounded font-sans font-medium whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                                      task.status === \'Blocked\'\\n                                        ? \'bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-950/60 text-red-700 dark:text-red-300 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60\'\\n                                        : task.status === \'Done\'\\n                                        ? \'bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-900/60\'\\n                                        : \'bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\'\\n                                    }`}\\n                                  >\\n                                    {task.status}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <span\\n                                  className={`text-[10px] font-semibold whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                                    task.priority === \'Urgent\'\\n                                      ? \'text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\'\\n                                      : task.priority === \'High\'\\n                                      ? \'text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\'\\n                                      : \'text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400\'\\n                                  }`}\\n                                >\\n                                  {task.priority}\\n                                </span>\\n                              </div>\\n\\n                              {/* Task Title */}\\n                              <button\\n                                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                onClick={() => onOpenTask(task.id)}\\n                                className=\\\"text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 line-clamp-2 block w-full\\\"\\n                              >\\n                                {task.title}\\n                              </button>\\n\\n                              {/* Visual Sub-task / Checklist Progress Indicator */}\\n                              {checklist.hasChecklist && (\\n                                <div\\n                                  data-testid={`kanban-checklist-progress-${task.taskCode}`}\\n                                  className=\\\"p-2 rounded-md bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    <button\\n                                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                      onClick={() => toggleChecklistExpand(task.id)}\\n                                      className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400\\\"\\n                                    >\\n                                      <ListChecks\\n                                        className={`w-3 h-3 ${\\n                                          checklist.isComplete\\n                                            ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\'\\n                                            : \'text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\'\\n                                        }`}\\n                                      />\\n                                      <span>\\n                                        {checklist.source === \'subtasks\' ? \'Sub-tasks\' : \'Checklist\'}\\n                                      </span>\\n                                      {isChecklistExpanded ? (\\n                                        <ChevronUp className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                                      ) : (\\n                                        <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                                      )}\\n                                    </button>\\n                                    <span\\n                                      className={\\n                                        checklist.isComplete\\n                                          ? \'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold\'\\n                                          : \'text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold\'\\n                                      }\\n                                    >\\n                                      {checklist.completedCount}/{checklist.totalCount} ({checklist.percent}%)\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                  <div\\n                                    role=\\\"progressbar\\\"\\n                                    aria-label={`${task.taskCode} kanban checklist progress`}\\n                                    aria-valuenow={checklist.percent}\\n                                    aria-valuemin={0}\\n                                    aria-valuemax={100}\\n                                    className=\\\"w-full h-1.5 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-full overflow-hidden\\\"\\n                                  >\\n                                    <div\\n                                      className={`h-full transition-all duration-300 rounded-full ${\\n                                        checklist.isComplete\\n                                          ? \'bg-emerald-500 dark:bg-emerald-400\'\\n                                          : \'bg-indigo-600 dark:bg-indigo-400\'\\n                                      }`}\\n                                      style={{ width: `${checklist.percent}%` }}\\n                                    />\\n                                  </div>\\n\\n                                  {isChecklistExpanded && (\\n                                    <div className=\\\"pt-1 space-y-1 border-t border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                                      {checklist.items.map((item) => (\\n                                        <button\\n                                          key={item.id}\\n                                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                          onClick={() =>\\n                                            onToggleSubtask && onToggleSubtask(task.id, item.id)\\n                                          }\\n                                          className=\\\"w-full flex items-start gap-1.5 text-left text-[10px] py-0.5 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600\\\"\\n                                        >\\n                                          <span\\n                                            className={`mt-0.5 w-3 h-3 rounded flex items-center justify-center border shrink-0 ${\\n                                              item.completed\\n                                                ? \'bg-emerald-600 border-emerald-600 text-white\'\\n                                                : \'border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\'\\n                                            }`}\\n                                          >\\n                                            {item.completed && <Check className=\\\"w-2 h-2\\\" />}\\n                                          </span>\\n                                          <span\\n                                            className={\\n                                              item.completed\\n                                                ? \'line-through text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500\'\\n                                                : \'\'\\n                                            }\\n                                          >\\n                                            {item.title}\\n                                          </span>\\n                                        </button>\\n                                      ))}\\n                                    </div>\\n                                  )}\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n\\n                              {/* Repository & Git Summary */}\\n                              {firstRepo && prog && (\\n                                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"truncate text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                    {firstRepo.repositoryName} \302\267{\' \'}\\n                                    <span className=\\\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\">\\n                                      {firstRepo.workingBranch}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                  <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    <span>\\n                                      Git: {prog.completedCount}/{prog.applicableCount} ({prog.percent}%)\\n                                    </span>\\n                                    <span>Due: {formatUnambiguousDate(task.dueDate, timezone, false)}</span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n\\n                              {/* Quick Workflow Stage & Granular Status Controls */}\\n                              <div className=\\\"pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                                <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1\\\">\\n                                  {BOARD_WORKFLOW_COLUMNS.map((targetCol) => {\\n                                    const isCurrentCol = currentColId === targetCol.id;\\n                                    return (\\n                                      <button\\n                                        key={targetCol.id}\\n                                        type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                        data-testid={`quick-move-${task.taskCode}-${targetCol.id}`}\\n                                        disabled={isCurrentCol}\\n                                        onClick={() =>\\n                                          handleMoveTaskToWorkflowColumn(task.id, targetCol.id)\\n                                        }\\n                                        className={`py-1 px-0.5 text-[9.5px] tracking-tight font-medium rounded border transition-colors text-center whitespace-nowrap ${\\n                                          isCurrentCol\\n                                            ? \'bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/60 border-indigo-300 dark:border-indigo-800 text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300 cursor-default\'\\n                                            : \'bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-300\'\\n                                        }`}\\n                                        title={`Move ${task.taskCode} to ${targetCol.label}`}\\n                                      >\\n                                        {targetCol.label}\\n                                      </button>\\n                                    );\\n                                  })}\\n                                </div>\\n\\n                                <select\\n                                  aria-label={`Move ${task.taskCode} to status`}\\n                                  value={task.status}\\n                                  onChange={(e) =>\\n                                    onUpdateTaskStatus(task.id, e.target.value as TaskStatus)\\n                                  }\\n                                  className=\\\"w-full px-2 py-1 text-[11px] rounded border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  {ALL_STATUSES.map((st) => (\\n                                    <option key={st} value={st}>\\n                                      Status: {st}\\n                                    </option>\\n                                  ))}\\n                                </select>\\n                              </div>\\n                            </div>\\n                          );\\n                        })\\n                      )}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            /* 7-Stage Granular Drag-and-Drop View */\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4 pb-2\\\">\\n              {ALL_STATUSES.map((colStatus) => {\\n                const colTasks = filteredTasks.filter((t) => t.status === colStatus);\\n                const isDropActive = dragOverColumnId === colStatus;\\n                return (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={colStatus}\\n                    data-testid={`detailed-column-${colStatus}`}\\n                    onDragOver={(e) => handleColumnDragOver(e, colStatus)}\\n                    onDragLeave={(e) => handleColumnDragLeave(e, colStatus)}\\n                    onDrop={(e) => handleDetailedStatusDrop(e, colStatus)}\\n                    className={`flex flex-col rounded-xl p-3.5 min-h-[260px] transition-all border ${\\n                      isDropActive\\n                        ? \'bg-indigo-50/70 dark:bg-indigo-950/30 border-indigo-500 ring-2 ring-indigo-500/20\'\\n                        : \'bg-slate-100/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                      <h3 className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">\\n                        {colStatus}\\n                      </h3>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono tabular-nums text-slate-500\\\">\\n                        {colTasks.length}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"space-y-2.5 flex-1\\\">\\n                      {colTasks.length === 0 ? (\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-24 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600 border border-dashed border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                          No tasks in {colStatus}\\n                        </div>\\n                      ) : (\\n                        colTasks.map((task) => {\\n                          const firstRepo = task.repositories[0];\\n                          const prog = firstRepo ? summarizeRepositoryProgress(firstRepo) : null;\\n                          const checklist = summarizeTaskChecklistProgress(task);\\n                          const isChecklistExpanded = Boolean(expandedChecklistIds[task.id]);\\n\\n                          return (\\n                            <div\\n                              key={task.id}\\n                              draggable\\n                              onDragStart={(e) => handleTaskDragStart(e, task.id)}\\n                              onDragEnd={handleTaskDragEnd}\\n                              className=\\\"p-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-400 space-y-2 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\\\"\\n                            >\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500\\\">\\n                                <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                                  {task.taskCode}\\n                                </span>\\n                                <span className=\\\"whitespace-nowrap\\\">{task.priority}</span>\\n                              </div>\\n                              <button\\n                                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                onClick={() => onOpenTask(task.id)}\\n                                className=\\\"text-left text-xs font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400 line-clamp-2 block\\\"\\n                              >\\n                                {task.title}\\n                              </button>\\n\\n                              {checklist.hasChecklist && (\\n                                <div className=\\\"p-2 rounded-md bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono tabular-nums\\\">\\n                                    <button\\n                                      type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                                      onClick={() => toggleChecklistExpand(task.id)}\\n                                      className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-sans font-medium text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:text-indigo-600 dark:hover:text-indigo-400\\\"\\n                                    >\\n                                      <ListChecks className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\" />\\n                                      <span>\\n                                        {checklist.source === \'subtasks\' ? \'Sub-tasks\' : \'Checklist\'}\\n                                      </span>\\n                                    </button>\\n                                    <span>\\n                                      {checklist.completedCount}/{checklist.totalCount} ({checklist.percent}%)\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n\\n                              {firstRepo && prog && (\\n                                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800\\\">\\n                                  <div className=\\\"truncate text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\\\">\\n                                    {firstRepo.repositoryName} \302\267{\' \'}\\n                                    <span className=\\\"text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400\\\">\\n                                      {firstRepo.workingBranch}\\n                                    </span>\\n                                  </div>\\n                                </div>\\n                              )}\\n                            </div>\\n                          );\\n                        })\\n                      )}\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\", \"TargetFile\":\"/MIHIR/src/components/TaskListView.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating Board View JSX with same-column drag-and-drop reordering\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add card reordering JSX in TaskListView.tsx\"}"
