  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Component Integrations**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the recent changes across several key components. Specifically, I\'m working with `NewTaskModal.tsx`, `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`, `TaskDetailView.tsx`, `TaskGitWorkflowSection.tsx` and other related components to ensure seamless functionality and a consistent user experience. I\'m aiming for smooth data flow and interaction between all these parts of the application.\n\n\n**Refining Task Modal Logic**\n\nI\'m currently overhauling the NewTaskModal component. The focus is on automatic task ID assignment whenever the modal opens or the suggested task code updates. I\'m also ensuring default working branches are set on selected repositories based on the suggested task code and resetting the form after task creation. This includes an \"Auto\" badge for the Task ID field, and the component now accepts an `onSaveRepository` prop for handling custom repos. I\'m aiming for automatic ID\'s and a smooth selection of existing or new repos.\n\n\n**Adding Repository Form**\n\nI\'m now implementing an inline form within `NewTaskModal.tsx`. It will sit next to the repositories list and will provide fields for a repository or custom folder name and the default base branch. Clicking \"Add & Select\" will persist the repo data in SQLite via `onSaveRepository` and also include it in the `selectedRepos` list, using the `baseBranch` and a `workingBranch` automatically derived from the task code.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Streamlining Repository Display**\n\nI\'ve removed the folder path display from selected repository cards in `NewTaskModal.tsx` and now added a \"Remove\" button instead. I\'m also simplifying the branch options in the task modal by reducing the choices to just \"Base Branch\" and \"Working Branch,\" removing the \"Dev Target Branch\" option. This will keep the interface simpler and more intuitive for users.\n\n\n**Simplifying Branch Options**\n\nI\'m now streamlining the branch configuration in `Modal.tsx`. I\'ve reduced the branch selection to just \"Base Branch\" and \"Working Branch,\" with the \"Dev Target\" automatically synced with the \"Base Branch\" behind the scenes, ensuring data model validity. I\'m also implementing the `handleSaveRepository` function and passing it to the `NewTaskModal` and `TaskDetailView` components. Finally, I\'m updating `TaskDetailView.tsx` to include Ray repositories or custom folders in its description.\n\n\n**Refining Repository Displays**\n\nI\'m now extending the repository display refinements to `TaskDetailView.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m removing the local workspace path and streamlining branch options to just \"Base Branch\" and \"Working Branch\" in the repository cards, and I am adding an inline \"+ Add Repo / Custom Folder\" option in the section B. I also am extending this effort to `ProjectsReposView.tsx`, removing the local workspace path from the repo cards and streamlining branch options and form fields to improve focus. Finally, I\'m verifying changes in `NewTaskModal.tsx` and `MihirWorkspaceApp.tsx`.\n\n\n"
